(5437830, 782321, 105585, '<td valign="top">Good DOF, angle...</td>', 'Good DOF, angle...', '2009-04-15 01:27:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5437835, 781898, 83313, '<td valign="top">Simple, strong, and I love the light you caught on this. My first fave of the challenge.</td>', 'Simple, strong, and I love the light you caught on this. My first fave of the challenge.', '2009-04-15 01:28:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5437847, 782277, 83313, '<td valign="top">Love it! A unique take on the challenge. I''m afraid you are probably going to get killed with DNMC votes from others, but I think you knew that going in. You''ll at least get a high vote from me, and I think I am safe in giving this my blue shoehorn really early on. Usually, these are simply for humor, not shoehorning, but I think it may count for both this time. Damn the torpedoes and low votes!<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=737193" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/83313/120/737193.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/83313/120/737193.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/83313/120/737193.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Love it! A unique take on the challenge. I''m afraid you are probably going to get killed with DNMC votes from others, but I think you knew that going in. You''ll at least get a high vote from me, and I think I am safe in giving this my blue shoehorn really early on. Usually, these are simply for humor, not shoehorning, but I think it may count for both this time. Damn the torpedoes and low votes!', '2009-04-15 01:35:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5437978, 782334, 105585, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting, perspective and color contrast.</td>', 'I like the lighting, perspective and color contrast.', '2009-04-15 03:41:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5437985, 782286, 105585, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but even better if we could see the person''s facial expression and hands. I think hand and facial expressions can speak volumes in photos.</td>', 'Good idea, but even better if we could see the person''s facial expression and hands. I think hand and facial expressions can speak volumes in photos.', '2009-04-15 03:46:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5437986, 782052, 105585, '<td valign="top">Background''s blown out some.</td>', 'Background''s blown out some.', '2009-04-15 03:47:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5437987, 781888, 105585, '<td valign="top">too blurred and washed out.</td>', 'too blurred and washed out.', '2009-04-15 03:47:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5437993, 782203, 37252, '<td valign="top">I really like the old nostalgic feel of this shot - great pp</td>', 'I really like the old nostalgic feel of this shot - great pp', '2009-04-15 03:55:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5437997, 781160, 105585, '<td valign="top">Good DOF, nice rich tone/colors.</td>', 'Good DOF, nice rich tone/colors.', '2009-04-15 04:02:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5438052, 781452, 60173, '<td valign="top">Your eye is drawn to the trolley, and then you look up expecting to see a blue sky or a mountain only to find a whole city. Quite surprising! Beautiful area.</td>', 'Your eye is drawn to the trolley, and then you look up expecting to see a blue sky or a mountain only to find a whole city. Quite surprising! Beautiful area.', '2009-04-15 05:10:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5438054, 781536, 60173, '<td valign="top">Aww, poor little train car. It looks so sad all cuddled up against the brush.</td>', 'Aww, poor little train car. It looks so sad all cuddled up against the brush.', '2009-04-15 05:16:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5438085, 782184, 35467, '<td valign="top">love it! Well done</td>', 'love it! Well done', '2009-04-15 05:52:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5438096, 782418, 79079, '<td valign="top">I thought I had found a unique place to shoot my entry from...  I guess not!  ;)  Were you as surprised as I was when you saw "the other" shot of this scene in this challenge?  :P</td>', 'I thought I had found a unique place to shoot my entry from...  I guess not!  ;)  Were you as surprised as I was when you saw "the other" shot of this scene in this challenge?  :P', '2009-04-15 05:57:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5438119, 782224, 72261, '<td valign="top">very nice idea</td>', 'very nice idea', '2009-04-15 06:38:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5438127, 782051, 70484, '<td valign="top">Already voted, back to comment. I like the feel of this shot. The angle is nice and the barefeet are a nice touch. I think the tone works well. The only thing I really don''t like is the cowboy hat, not exactly sure why I don''t like it, but I just don''t. Didn''t take points away for it because it''s my problem not yours :-) 10</td>', 'Already voted, back to comment. I like the feel of this shot. The angle is nice and the barefeet are a nice touch. I think the tone works well. The only thing I really don''t like is the cowboy hat, not exactly sure why I don''t like it, but I just don''t. Didn''t take points away for it because it''s my problem not yours :-) 10', '2009-04-15 06:51:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5438128, 781177, 70484, '<td valign="top">Already voted, back to comment. This is probably not doing so well in the voting, but I love it!!! The simplicity of it speaks volumes. The lights are great with their flares and enough of the track is lit up to make it stand out. The composition is good and I like the low key feel. I love the artistic quality of this set up. 10</td>', 'Already voted, back to comment. This is probably not doing so well in the voting, but I love it!!! The simplicity of it speaks volumes. The lights are great with their flares and enough of the track is lit up to make it stand out. The composition is good and I like the low key feel. I love the artistic quality of this set up. 10', '2009-04-15 06:53:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5438142, 782172, 102534, '<td valign="top">this really pops out at you. the bridge frames it nicely</td>', 'this really pops out at you. the bridge frames it nicely', '2009-04-15 07:27:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5438146, 782353, 97982, '<td valign="top">I like the contrasts, too bad there weren''t some big thunder clouds, or breaks in the clouds - but i like the even flow of the shot.</td>', 'I like the contrasts, too bad there weren''t some big thunder clouds, or breaks in the clouds - but i like the even flow of the shot.', '2009-04-15 07:42:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5438147, 782205, 97982, '<td valign="top">I love the classic train stations - great perspective!</td>', 'I love the classic train stations - great perspective!', '2009-04-15 07:44:31.000000', NULL, 1),
