(5438364, 782229, 44025, '<td valign="top">If the silhouetted engine is the subject, then there isn''t enough shape to be interesting enough for a subject. If the crane is the subject, then it shouldn''t be in the center of the photograph. Just my humble opinion...I''ve never scored higher than a 5.4 ;)</td>', 'If the silhouetted engine is the subject, then there isn''t enough shape to be interesting enough for a subject. If the crane is the subject, then it shouldn''t be in the center of the photograph. Just my humble opinion...I''ve never scored higher than a 5.4 ;)', '2009-04-15 09:49:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5438365, 782224, 32749, '<td valign="top">A well taken and funny photo. I think I would prefer it if the train was closer to the camera, but that is just my opinion.</td>', 'A well taken and funny photo. I think I would prefer it if the train was closer to the camera, but that is just my opinion.', '2009-04-15 09:49:44.000000', NULL, 1),
