(5438373, 782371, 44025, '<td valign="top">Lighting wasn''t very good. Perhaps this picture would have been better if it was taken at sunset or sunrise. Also, focusing more on the foreground thna the background to place additional emphasis on the subject. This could have created a background with nice cascade of color.</td>', 'Lighting wasn''t very good. Perhaps this picture would have been better if it was taken at sunset or sunrise. Also, focusing more on the foreground thna the background to place additional emphasis on the subject. This could have created a background with nice cascade of color.', '2009-04-15 09:56:05.000000', NULL, 1),
