(5438644, 782301, 98141, '<td valign="top">Great fisheye shot, I love the colors here and it''s an interesting and unique subject for the challenge.</td>', 'Great fisheye shot, I love the colors here and it''s an interesting and unique subject for the challenge.', '2009-04-15 12:01:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5438646, 782161, 98141, '<td valign="top">Your processing/sepia colors for this work well with your title.</td>', 'Your processing/sepia colors for this work well with your title.', '2009-04-15 12:02:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5438647, 781962, 98141, '<td valign="top">Great composition, I love how long the train looks since it runs from corner to corner and the smoke covers the end of the train.</td>', 'Great composition, I love how long the train looks since it runs from corner to corner and the smoke covers the end of the train.', '2009-04-15 12:02:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5438652, 781678, 98141, '<td valign="top">This almost feels like a toy set, but I can''t figure out why. Great colors in the blue and yellow of the trains, I''m glad you didn''t convert it.</td>', 'This almost feels like a toy set, but I can''t figure out why. Great colors in the blue and yellow of the trains, I''m glad you didn''t convert it.', '2009-04-15 12:03:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5438654, 782342, 98141, '<td valign="top">Very interesting pic, works well in the black and white with the lines the way they are.</td>', 'Very interesting pic, works well in the black and white with the lines the way they are.', '2009-04-15 12:04:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5438655, 781645, 98141, '<td valign="top">The square frame works well for this, I think a little shallower DOF would help with the distracting buildings in the background.</td>', 'The square frame works well for this, I think a little shallower DOF would help with the distracting buildings in the background.', '2009-04-15 12:04:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5438658, 782405, 98141, '<td valign="top">What a strange and fun shot - I think the contrast could be bumped up a bit, but I am a high-contrast junkie :)</td>', 'What a strange and fun shot - I think the contrast could be bumped up a bit, but I am a high-contrast junkie :)', '2009-04-15 12:05:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5438666, 781656, 98141, '<td valign="top">I think the light from the fill flash feels a bit harsh in this (the shadows give it away). The telephone wire is distracting as well. I might suggest a different angle for this shot since you can''t edit out the line in Basic.</td>', 'I think the light from the fill flash feels a bit harsh in this (the shadows give it away). The telephone wire is distracting as well. I might suggest a different angle for this shot since you can''t edit out the line in Basic.', '2009-04-15 12:06:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5438668, 782302, 98141, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition, you can tell this train has got places to go. I think the clarity of the trees is a little distracting since they take up so much of the frame, if they were a little softer I think the focus would be more on the engine.</td>', 'Interesting composition, you can tell this train has got places to go. I think the clarity of the trees is a little distracting since they take up so much of the frame, if they were a little softer I think the focus would be more on the engine.', '2009-04-15 12:07:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5438670, 781679, 98141, '<td valign="top">I like this shot a lot, it''s different and kind of spooky. Love the composition with the tracks being on an angle like that.</td>', 'I like this shot a lot, it''s different and kind of spooky. Love the composition with the tracks being on an angle like that.', '2009-04-15 12:08:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5438674, 782338, 98141, '<td valign="top">The fire-engine red of this is really nice. I think the crop is a little to tight for my tastes.</td>', 'The fire-engine red of this is really nice. I think the crop is a little to tight for my tastes.', '2009-04-15 12:09:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5438676, 781860, 98141, '<td valign="top">Nice old-timey feel, good PP. For once I actually think that a center composition would work better than the angle here, to get more of a tunnel effect.</td>', 'Nice old-timey feel, good PP. For once I actually think that a center composition would work better than the angle here, to get more of a tunnel effect.', '2009-04-15 12:09:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5438678, 782380, 98141, '<td valign="top">This falls flat to me. I think it''s lacking something to make it pop. The subject, composition, framing - it all is just a little to plain to make it stand out in a crowd.</td>', 'This falls flat to me. I think it''s lacking something to make it pop. The subject, composition, framing - it all is just a little to plain to make it stand out in a crowd.', '2009-04-15 12:10:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5438679, 782372, 98141, '<td valign="top">I love the POV right inside the tracks like that.</td>', 'I love the POV right inside the tracks like that.', '2009-04-15 12:11:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5438681, 781389, 98141, '<td valign="top">If I didn''t know this was a Trains &amp; Railroads challenge, I would have no idea that I was looking at an abandoned station. This photo has no real subject to me.</td>', 'If I didn''t know this was a Trains & Railroads challenge, I would have no idea that I was looking at an abandoned station. This photo has no real subject to me.', '2009-04-15 12:12:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5438683, 781515, 98141, '<td valign="top">Great use of shallow DOF, I like the composition as well, the way the bottom right corner wraps right around the edge of the track bolt thingy (I wish I knew what that was called so I didn''t ruin a perfectly good comment with my ignorance, oh well :P</td>', 'Great use of shallow DOF, I like the composition as well, the way the bottom right corner wraps right around the edge of the track bolt thingy (I wish I knew what that was called so I didn''t ruin a perfectly good comment with my ignorance, oh well :P', '2009-04-15 12:13:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5438685, 781453, 98141, '<td valign="top">I like that a modern building/city is in the background. It''s a nice contrast to the antiquity of the tracks.</td>', 'I like that a modern building/city is in the background. It''s a nice contrast to the antiquity of the tracks.', '2009-04-15 12:14:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5438688, 782371, 98141, '<td valign="top">It''s creepy how similar our tracks are. Except my flag was green and read, what does yellow mean? I like the way the flag contraption is in between the red train and the yellow train, great composition, like it''s preventing them from coming into contact (which is it''s job after all).</td>', 'It''s creepy how similar our tracks are. Except my flag was green and read, what does yellow mean? I like the way the flag contraption is in between the red train and the yellow train, great composition, like it''s preventing them from coming into contact (which is it''s job after all).', '2009-04-15 12:15:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5438691, 781852, 98141, '<td valign="top">Great smoke, great mountain pass location. I kind of wish somebody wre on the platform to add a bit of interest to that really open, white space in the pic.</td>', 'Great smoke, great mountain pass location. I kind of wish somebody wre on the platform to add a bit of interest to that really open, white space in the pic.', '2009-04-15 12:16:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5438692, 781471, 98141, '<td valign="top">I think this would work really well in color, actually. I like the composition but I think the color would make it pop more. The sky looks like it would be perfect, a nice mix of blue and white.</td>', 'I think this would work really well in color, actually. I like the composition but I think the color would make it pop more. The sky looks like it would be perfect, a nice mix of blue and white.', '2009-04-15 12:17:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5438694, 782046, 98141, '<td valign="top">I can''t tell if it''s glare or dust, but there are some spots that are distracting above the bridge. Not the sharpest pic, but not bad for doing it by starlight either. If more of the sky were included, it would be easier to see the motion of the stars and your title would make sense right away.</td>', 'I can''t tell if it''s glare or dust, but there are some spots that are distracting above the bridge. Not the sharpest pic, but not bad for doing it by starlight either. If more of the sky were included, it would be easier to see the motion of the stars and your title would make sense right away.', '2009-04-15 12:18:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5438695, 781723, 98141, '<td valign="top">Great train, great composition, very classic.</td>', 'Great train, great composition, very classic.', '2009-04-15 12:19:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5438696, 782024, 98141, '<td valign="top">I think having the tracks to off at more of an angle, like from corner to corner, would be better for this shot instead of having the rail go straight up the pic.</td>', 'I think having the tracks to off at more of an angle, like from corner to corner, would be better for this shot instead of having the rail go straight up the pic.', '2009-04-15 12:20:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5438704, 782203, 98141, '<td valign="top">There''s a really nice, smooth quality about the textures in this pic that I really dig.</td>', 'There''s a really nice, smooth quality about the textures in this pic that I really dig.', '2009-04-15 12:26:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5438705, 782388, 98141, '<td valign="top">I really like this. Very creative. Were you actually on a train for this shot? I''m curious how you took it.</td>', 'I really like this. Very creative. Were you actually on a train for this shot? I''m curious how you took it.', '2009-04-15 12:27:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5438707, 782067, 98005, '<td valign="top">OMG I grew up in Astoria.  Took the Steinway Station to high school for four years!  Gave you a 10 - how could I not???</td>', 'OMG I grew up in Astoria.  Took the Steinway Station to high school for four years!  Gave you a 10 - how could I not???', '2009-04-15 12:29:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5438708, 782369, 98141, '<td valign="top">This falls flat for me. Everything kind of blends together and there''s not a strong enough angle to get some nice depth going.</td>', 'This falls flat for me. Everything kind of blends together and there''s not a strong enough angle to get some nice depth going.', '2009-04-15 12:30:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5438710, 782172, 98141, '<td valign="top">I love this. I love the textures of it all, very smooth. I''m assuming this is Lensbaby? Great job with the focus point, that can be hard to nail. I hope you don''t get low-voted for it being a tram, as long as it''s on a track I think it qualifies!</td>', 'I love this. I love the textures of it all, very smooth. I''m assuming this is Lensbaby? Great job with the focus point, that can be hard to nail. I hope you don''t get low-voted for it being a tram, as long as it''s on a track I think it qualifies!', '2009-04-15 12:33:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5438712, 782021, 98141, '<td valign="top">I don''t think anything here pops or is very clear.</td>', 'I don''t think anything here pops or is very clear.', '2009-04-15 12:33:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5438714, 781869, 98141, '<td valign="top">I love the starry shape of the lights and the other-worldly look of the tunnel. Great colors. This pops!</td>', 'I love the starry shape of the lights and the other-worldly look of the tunnel. Great colors. This pops!', '2009-04-15 12:34:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5438715, 781301, 98141, '<td valign="top">Not close enough and too close all at the same time. Not close enough to be a great macro shot, but not inclusive enough to give us a sense of what we''re looking at imho. Great red, though.</td>', 'Not close enough and too close all at the same time. Not close enough to be a great macro shot, but not inclusive enough to give us a sense of what we''re looking at imho. Great red, though.', '2009-04-15 12:35:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5438716, 782431, 98141, '<td valign="top">The contrast could use to go way up imho, but it''s a really neat idea for a shot.</td>', 'The contrast could use to go way up imho, but it''s a really neat idea for a shot.', '2009-04-15 12:35:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5438719, 782170, 98141, '<td valign="top">Great colors between the sky, grass and flowers. I like that it''s all reflected in the window on the train.</td>', 'Great colors between the sky, grass and flowers. I like that it''s all reflected in the window on the train.', '2009-04-15 12:36:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5438764, 782226, 92577, '<td valign="top">cool location  -  nice shot</td>', 'cool location  -  nice shot', '2009-04-15 13:14:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5438775, 782396, 98186, '<td valign="top">My initial impression is that it''s just too dark, but when I stop and think about how the sunset reflects off the tracks so that really all you see is the orange glowing tracks heading straight toward the sunset... it''s really cool!</td>', 'My initial impression is that it''s just too dark, but when I stop and think about how the sunset reflects off the tracks so that really all you see is the orange glowing tracks heading straight toward the sunset... it''s really cool!', '2009-04-15 13:24:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5438778, 782203, 92577, '<td valign="top">I like this image in so many ways. Maybe the composition could be a little stronger for more impact? good luck - 8</td>', 'I like this image in so many ways. Maybe the composition could be a little stronger for more impact? good luck - 8', '2009-04-15 13:26:43.000000', NULL, 1),
