(5439550, 780758, 105969, '<td valign="top">This image is awesome. I love urban art and photography so this really appeals to me. I think the placement of the light is great and I love the title!</td>', 'This image is awesome. I love urban art and photography so this really appeals to me. I think the placement of the light is great and I love the title!', '2009-04-15 22:28:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5439551, 782119, 105969, '<td valign="top">Cute idea.</td>', 'Cute idea.', '2009-04-15 22:30:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5439553, 782406, 105969, '<td valign="top">Great colors and placement!</td>', 'Great colors and placement!', '2009-04-15 22:31:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5439556, 782396, 105969, '<td valign="top">Pretty.</td>', 'Pretty.', '2009-04-15 22:31:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5439560, 782106, 105969, '<td valign="top">Awesome! I love the perspective and internal layering.</td>', 'Awesome! I love the perspective and internal layering.', '2009-04-15 22:33:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5439583, 782133, 96881, '<td valign="top">Such a shame you can''t Spell Ballarat........<br/>I like the Shapes in Southern Crosses Roof, but the mispell is such a distraction from the overall image</td>', 'Such a shame you can''t Spell Ballarat........I like the Shapes in Southern Crosses Roof, but the mispell is such a distraction from the overall image', '2009-04-15 23:02:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5439662, 781505, 37845, '<td valign="top">Good luck with this J... I hope it does well. VitB</td>', 'Good luck with this J... I hope it does well. VitB', '2009-04-16 00:13:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5439683, 782004, 53668, '<td valign="top">I luvvv this!  One of the top three shots in this challenge.</td>', 'I luvvv this!  One of the top three shots in this challenge.', '2009-04-16 00:39:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5439687, 781127, 53668, '<td valign="top">This is gorgeous - your going to do well with this entry.</td>', 'This is gorgeous - your going to do well with this entry.', '2009-04-16 00:40:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5439689, 781856, 53668, '<td valign="top">I like the ''low down''...and I am glad somebody came to untie you in time to post this in the challenge.</td>', 'I like the ''low down''...and I am glad somebody came to untie you in time to post this in the challenge.', '2009-04-16 00:42:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5439692, 782265, 53668, '<td valign="top">This works very well with the diagonal and horizontal leading lines. Classy touch with the sepia shade - unifies it all together</td>', 'This works very well with the diagonal and horizontal leading lines. Classy touch with the sepia shade - unifies it all together', '2009-04-16 00:45:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5439789, 782372, 83313, '<td valign="top">Good perspective and tonal treatment. Not anything that hasn''t been done before, but that could be said about many of mine. ...and the original ones of mine tend to bomb, so take my input for what it''s worth! (Which is $0)</td>', 'Good perspective and tonal treatment. Not anything that hasn''t been done before, but that could be said about many of mine. ...and the original ones of mine tend to bomb, so take my input for what it''s worth! (Which is $0)', '2009-04-16 01:21:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5439795, 782232, 83313, '<td valign="top">I''m looking, I''m looking! Waiting for you to do a trick or something. I like the perspective and composition. I think you were probably aware of those really dark shadows on the left hiding lots of detail.</td>', 'I''m looking, I''m looking! Waiting for you to do a trick or something. I like the perspective and composition. I think you were probably aware of those really dark shadows on the left hiding lots of detail.', '2009-04-16 01:22:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5439802, 781739, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like the tones and treatment. The composition does not work as good for me as it could, though. I think it''s the angle of the line the rail is taking through the frame. That''s not any real flaw, just an "I would have done it some other way" kind of thing.</td>', 'I like the tones and treatment. The composition does not work as good for me as it could, though. I think it''s the angle of the line the rail is taking through the frame. That''s not any real flaw, just an "I would have done it some other way" kind of thing.', '2009-04-16 01:25:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5439805, 781200, 83313, '<td valign="top">It all fits in the frame of the photo as if it was meant to fit in a 640x430 pixel box. Nice greasy and rusty tones.</td>', 'It all fits in the frame of the photo as if it was meant to fit in a 640x430 pixel box. Nice greasy and rusty tones.', '2009-04-16 01:26:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5439807, 782433, 83313, '<td valign="top">Enjoying all the rust in this challenge.</td>', 'Enjoying all the rust in this challenge.', '2009-04-16 01:27:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5439812, 781116, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like this, but think it would have a more timeless look without the two guys in modern clothes.They also grab my eye, when my gaze would otherwise be led up to those great mountains.</td>', 'I like this, but think it would have a more timeless look without the two guys in modern clothes.They also grab my eye, when my gaze would otherwise be led up to those great mountains.', '2009-04-16 01:29:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5439819, 781125, 83313, '<td valign="top">Not sure what to say on this. Theres really just nothing here that my eye gets led to, or a main point that grabs my interest.<br/> <br/>Those rails do look really beat up.</td>', 'Not sure what to say on this. Theres really just nothing here that my eye gets led to, or a main point that grabs my interest. Those rails do look really beat up.', '2009-04-16 01:31:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5439820, 781505, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice and smooooooothhhh. Faving it.</td>', 'Nice and smooooooothhhh. Faving it.', '2009-04-16 01:32:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5439825, 782283, 83313, '<td valign="top">Not as DNMC as some others. It may be a toy train, but it IS a train. My beef with it is not about fitting the challenge. At only 26k in size, you used a lot of JPEG compression in this pic and it is probably what is taking away most of the detail and impact. Compression kills detail. Always adjust JPEG compression so that your file size is as large as possible, but within the challenge limit. (150k for this one)</td>', 'Not as DNMC as some others. It may be a toy train, but it IS a train. My beef with it is not about fitting the challenge. At only 26k in size, you used a lot of JPEG compression in this pic and it is probably what is taking away most of the detail and impact. Compression kills detail. Always adjust JPEG compression so that your file size is as large as possible, but within the challenge limit. (150k for this one)', '2009-04-16 01:34:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5439827, 781536, 83313, '<td valign="top">Looks like its been there a while. Not sure what it is or is not about this one. I think maybe it''s the composition. My eye gets led right past the subject without stopping. I find myself looking down the tracks instead of at the train.</td>', 'Looks like its been there a while. Not sure what it is or is not about this one. I think maybe it''s the composition. My eye gets led right past the subject without stopping. I find myself looking down the tracks instead of at the train.', '2009-04-16 01:36:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5439831, 781656, 83313, '<td valign="top">Very cool service vehicle. Any idea what this thing does? While I was out shooting for the gas stations challenge, I took a pic of a maintenance train that essentially cleans the rocks under the railway. Took me some research to find out what it was, however.<br/> <br/>The pic itself may just need a little boost in wow-factor to make it more DPC-friendly</td>', 'Very cool service vehicle. Any idea what this thing does? While I was out shooting for the gas stations challenge, I took a pic of a maintenance train that essentially cleans the rocks under the railway. Took me some research to find out what it was, however. The pic itself may just need a little boost in wow-factor to make it more DPC-friendly', '2009-04-16 01:39:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5439834, 782351, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like the zoomblur, not fond of the negative treatment, though.</td>', 'I like the zoomblur, not fond of the negative treatment, though.', '2009-04-16 01:40:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5439840, 781700, 83313, '<td valign="top">Ii can see you were trying to get an old fashioned early color look to this. I like the effort and the building is interesting. I wonder how a wideangle shot or a stronger perspective would have done for this? (I like strong perspectives.)</td>', 'Ii can see you were trying to get an old fashioned early color look to this. I like the effort and the building is interesting. I wonder how a wideangle shot or a stronger perspective would have done for this? (I like strong perspectives.)', '2009-04-16 01:42:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5439843, 782356, 83313, '<td valign="top">Not sure what part of the train this is, but you got some very nice lighting in the scene.</td>', 'Not sure what part of the train this is, but you got some very nice lighting in the scene.', '2009-04-16 01:43:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5439845, 781148, 83313, '<td valign="top">I guess the title means I have to give you a 6? Or that''s what you expect to average for this entry? I''ll do my part.</td>', 'I guess the title means I have to give you a 6? Or that''s what you expect to average for this entry? I''ll do my part.', '2009-04-16 01:44:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5439878, 781249, 105438, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to see more of the train in the shot. My eye is drawn to everything but the engine.</td>', 'I would have liked to see more of the train in the shot. My eye is drawn to everything but the engine.', '2009-04-16 02:31:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5439879, 782418, 16929, '<td valign="top">This is an awesome image. I like. 9</td>', 'This is an awesome image. I like. 9', '2009-04-16 02:31:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5439883, 780740, 105438, '<td valign="top">Nice color and texture. Definitely eye catching in the thumbnails! Would make a great print.</td>', 'Nice color and texture. Definitely eye catching in the thumbnails! Would make a great print.', '2009-04-16 02:36:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5439957, 781869, 99506, '<td valign="top">I think i would have preferred it without the red part, maybe cropped so that the light at the end was in the bottom left hand corner, but that''s just my opinion. Nice image and a good take on the challenge</td>', 'I think i would have preferred it without the red part, maybe cropped so that the light at the end was in the bottom left hand corner, but that''s just my opinion. Nice image and a good take on the challenge', '2009-04-16 05:30:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5439958, 781201, 99506, '<td valign="top">This has a very nice early morning feel to it although a bit more focus would have been nice</td>', 'This has a very nice early morning feel to it although a bit more focus would have been nice', '2009-04-16 05:31:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5439959, 782425, 99506, '<td valign="top">Great use of reflection here I like it</td>', 'Great use of reflection here I like it', '2009-04-16 05:32:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5439960, 781505, 99506, '<td valign="top">I''m impresssed that the ground is in focus as I would imagine that the train made the ground shake. Good work</td>', 'I''m impresssed that the ground is in focus as I would imagine that the train made the ground shake. Good work', '2009-04-16 05:32:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5439961, 782283, 99506, '<td valign="top">Tempted to give you a 10 to rob you of the brown lol</td>', 'Tempted to give you a 10 to rob you of the brown lol', '2009-04-16 05:34:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5439967, 782228, 99506, '<td valign="top">This has an almost sinister feel to it especially if you take the title into consideration.</td>', 'This has an almost sinister feel to it especially if you take the title into consideration.', '2009-04-16 05:35:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5439970, 782054, 99506, '<td valign="top">I shouldn''t fancy riding that at speed lol</td>', 'I shouldn''t fancy riding that at speed lol', '2009-04-16 05:36:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5439972, 782311, 99506, '<td valign="top">Leaves or left? lol</td>', 'Leaves or left? lol', '2009-04-16 05:37:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5439974, 782163, 99506, '<td valign="top">This has a real 1950s feel to it very nice</td>', 'This has a real 1950s feel to it very nice', '2009-04-16 05:38:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5439977, 782051, 99506, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot but I think i prefer it without the angle</td>', 'Very nice shot but I think i prefer it without the angle', '2009-04-16 05:39:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5440017, 782226, 67258, '<td valign="top">Woah, never seen one of these before!  Certainly an interesting photograph for this viewer.</td>', 'Woah, never seen one of these before!  Certainly an interesting photograph for this viewer.', '2009-04-16 07:50:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5440018, 782170, 67258, '<td valign="top">A pleasing gentle, quiet take on the challenge.</td>', 'A pleasing gentle, quiet take on the challenge.', '2009-04-16 07:51:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5440020, 782277, 67258, '<td valign="top">There had to be at least one, LOL! Unfortunately it isn''t the worlds best wedding photograph...</td>', 'There had to be at least one, LOL! Unfortunately it isn''t the worlds best wedding photograph...', '2009-04-16 07:53:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5440022, 781974, 67258, '<td valign="top">My favourite of the challenge - the panning is superb, and your choice of location, with the bright rape field in the foreground,is spot on. A very impressive image.</td>', 'My favourite of the challenge - the panning is superb, and your choice of location, with the bright rape field in the foreground,is spot on. A very impressive image.', '2009-04-16 07:54:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5440082, 782405, 31664, '<td valign="top">You realise this is a boat ramp not a rail line - DNMC</td>', 'You realise this is a boat ramp not a rail line - DNMC', '2009-04-16 09:18:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5440107, 782372, 96823, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.</td>', 'Nice shot.', '2009-04-16 09:39:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5440109, 781160, 81530, '<td valign="top">Looks great Peter. Good luck!</td>', 'Looks great Peter. Good luck!', '2009-04-16 09:40:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5440119, 781127, 96823, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, it''s just a little bright IMO.</td>', 'Nice shot, it''s just a little bright IMO.', '2009-04-16 09:42:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5440122, 782236, 98141, '<td valign="top">The angle here is dull imho and doesn''t give the photo much depth. I think it''s a cool subject though, the way it''s only on a little bit of track like that.</td>', 'The angle here is dull imho and doesn''t give the photo much depth. I think it''s a cool subject though, the way it''s only on a little bit of track like that.', '2009-04-16 09:43:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5440125, 782004, 98141, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot, I love the people waiting and the smoke being subtle. Seems like it''s from a movie.</td>', 'Wonderful shot, I love the people waiting and the smoke being subtle. Seems like it''s from a movie.', '2009-04-16 09:44:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5440126, 782332, 98141, '<td valign="top">Nice to see a creative angle going on here, the sky and colors on the train look fantastic.</td>', 'Nice to see a creative angle going on here, the sky and colors on the train look fantastic.', '2009-04-16 09:44:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5440131, 781160, 96823, '<td valign="top">Over all it''s a nice shot, the only thing is the green fence on the bottom left hand corner. Maybe a lower angle to hide the fence. JMO!</td>', 'Over all it''s a nice shot, the only thing is the green fence on the bottom left hand corner. Maybe a lower angle to hide the fence. JMO!', '2009-04-16 09:46:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5440132, 781680, 98141, '<td valign="top">What is the subject of this photo? The building? It''s too open with so much white/grey space from the cement. The telephone wires are distracting (though I realize you can''t edit them out in Basic). The composition leaves something to be desired. Not to be harsh. IMHO I think this photo needs something of a central focus.</td>', 'What is the subject of this photo? The building? It''s too open with so much white/grey space from the cement. The telephone wires are distracting (though I realize you can''t edit them out in Basic). The composition leaves something to be desired. Not to be harsh. IMHO I think this photo needs something of a central focus.', '2009-04-16 09:46:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5440135, 782403, 98141, '<td valign="top">While I love the colors here, the blue is beautiful, not overly saturated, but it still pops, I also think this photo lacks a bit of depth that a different angle/including more of the train would have provided.</td>', 'While I love the colors here, the blue is beautiful, not overly saturated, but it still pops, I also think this photo lacks a bit of depth that a different angle/including more of the train would have provided.', '2009-04-16 09:47:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5440139, 782163, 98141, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot, the smooth texture of everything, the shadow of the xing sign on the train, the blur - my only recommendation is to move the xing sign out from the exact middle of your pic since I don''t think there''s enough symmetry for that to work here.</td>', 'I like this a lot, the smooth texture of everything, the shadow of the xing sign on the train, the blur - my only recommendation is to move the xing sign out from the exact middle of your pic since I don''t think there''s enough symmetry for that to work here.', '2009-04-16 09:48:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5440142, 782356, 98141, '<td valign="top">Very cool shot, great use of motion blur.</td>', 'Very cool shot, great use of motion blur.', '2009-04-16 09:49:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5440146, 781854, 98141, '<td valign="top">I think that a slightly lower angle would have done better with this to move our eyes more toward the end of the tunnel rather than feel like we''re staring strait down at the tracks. I also think that using different composition, for example have the tracks originate in the bottom left corner instead of the whole bottom of the frame, would help move our eye along the photo better.</td>', 'I think that a slightly lower angle would have done better with this to move our eyes more toward the end of the tunnel rather than feel like we''re staring strait down at the tracks. I also think that using different composition, for example have the tracks originate in the bottom left corner instead of the whole bottom of the frame, would help move our eye along the photo better.', '2009-04-16 09:50:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5440148, 782182, 98141, '<td valign="top">The first thing that pops to me about this pic is the colors, the greens and browns work really well together. I like how far into the distance we can see.</td>', 'The first thing that pops to me about this pic is the colors, the greens and browns work really well together. I like how far into the distance we can see.', '2009-04-16 09:52:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5440150, 781505, 98141, '<td valign="top">Such a cool, purple sky! Great use of motion blur and lighting.</td>', 'Such a cool, purple sky! Great use of motion blur and lighting.', '2009-04-16 09:52:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5440151, 782341, 96823, '<td valign="top">IMO it''s just a snap shot of a train station.</td>', 'IMO it''s just a snap shot of a train station.', '2009-04-16 09:52:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5440152, 782439, 98141, '<td valign="top">The subject is nice and clear, the lighting is good. Not my fav., doesn''t have a lot of zing, but the technicals are great.</td>', 'The subject is nice and clear, the lighting is good. Not my fav., doesn''t have a lot of zing, but the technicals are great.', '2009-04-16 09:53:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5440156, 782133, 98141, '<td valign="top">This reminds me of the airport in Bilbao, Spain. I think there''s a lot going on in this pic, it''s very busy. The most distracting thing for me is the stuff in the lower left corner. I think if this were advanced editing that selective desat would help bring focus to the subject.</td>', 'This reminds me of the airport in Bilbao, Spain. I think there''s a lot going on in this pic, it''s very busy. The most distracting thing for me is the stuff in the lower left corner. I think if this were advanced editing that selective desat would help bring focus to the subject.', '2009-04-16 09:55:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5440157, 782131, 98141, '<td valign="top">Cool pic, out of the box, love the lighting.</td>', 'Cool pic, out of the box, love the lighting.', '2009-04-16 09:55:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5440160, 782340, 98141, '<td valign="top">I wonder if he''s dead or if you just have a really fast trigger finger? Great shot, my favorite thing is those wonderful trees in the background.</td>', 'I wonder if he''s dead or if you just have a really fast trigger finger? Great shot, my favorite thing is those wonderful trees in the background.', '2009-04-16 09:56:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5440162, 781201, 96823, '<td valign="top">It''s an good shot of a train, but maybe cropping it different would have help it. JMO!</td>', 'It''s an good shot of a train, but maybe cropping it different would have help it. JMO!', '2009-04-16 09:57:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5440164, 782229, 98141, '<td valign="top">A little dark is the first thing I notice. The composition is awkward - it''s like the train wants to run over the raised car. It''s also a little strange that the tracks don''t continue even though from the cropping it looks like the train continues. IMHO it feels awkward.</td>', 'A little dark is the first thing I notice. The composition is awkward - it''s like the train wants to run over the raised car. It''s also a little strange that the tracks don''t continue even though from the cropping it looks like the train continues. IMHO it feels awkward.', '2009-04-16 09:57:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5440165, 782228, 98141, '<td valign="top">Gloomy, kind of spooky, especially with your title :) Great composition. I love the somewhat haunted feeling.</td>', 'Gloomy, kind of spooky, especially with your title :) Great composition. I love the somewhat haunted feeling.', '2009-04-16 09:58:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5440171, 781328, 96823, '<td valign="top">I''m thinking that B&amp;W with sepia tone would have worked better and fixing the tilt. JMO</td>', 'I''m thinking that B&W with sepia tone would have worked better and fixing the tilt. JMO', '2009-04-16 10:03:54.000000', NULL, 1),
