(5440186, 781974, 98141, '<td valign="top">I love that yellow and you did a really good job of keeping the train in focus while the background blurred, please write up how you did this because I would love to read it in your comments afterward.</td>', 'I love that yellow and you did a really good job of keeping the train in focus while the background blurred, please write up how you did this because I would love to read it in your comments afterward.', '2009-04-16 10:12:03.000000', NULL, 1),
