(5440188, 782056, 98141, '<td valign="top">This is different. I don''t care for the color choice here, I think it would be better imho in black and white, but that''s a minor detail.</td>', 'This is different. I don''t care for the color choice here, I think it would be better imho in black and white, but that''s a minor detail.', '2009-04-16 10:13:24.000000', NULL, 1),
