(5440876, 782224, 509, '<td valign="top">Nicely done</td>', 'Nicely done', '2009-04-16 19:46:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5440877, 782314, 509, '<td valign="top">Looks pretty oversharpened imho</td>', 'Looks pretty oversharpened imho', '2009-04-16 19:47:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5440881, 782396, 509, '<td valign="top">Awesome work, I like the subtle qualities of this one.</td>', 'Awesome work, I like the subtle qualities of this one.', '2009-04-16 19:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5441085, 781810, 97703, '<td valign="top">Wished you had a side view of this one!</td>', 'Wished you had a side view of this one!', '2009-04-16 21:56:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5441218, 782283, 101256, '<td valign="top">This gets a ten just because it''s so damn funny - laugh-out-loud funny.</td>', 'This gets a ten just because it''s so damn funny - laugh-out-loud funny.', '2009-04-16 23:01:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5441249, 782278, 101256, '<td valign="top">Works for me - properly framed, good DOF control and the immediate impression is whimsical without being over bearing. Nothing jumps immediately to the eye as out of place and the colors compliment the foreground and background. Well done and a solid entry into the challenge because of it''s technical and artistsic success.</td>', 'Works for me - properly framed, good DOF control and the immediate impression is whimsical without being over bearing. Nothing jumps immediately to the eye as out of place and the colors compliment the foreground and background. Well done and a solid entry into the challenge because of it''s technical and artistsic success.', '2009-04-16 23:20:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5441256, 782131, 101256, '<td valign="top">An odd capture that has some technical merit, but from an artistic standpoint does not quite match. A longer tracking shot would have helped this in a lot of ways. A larger image evoking a sense of speed, space and time would also have helped. A good entry into the challenge.</td>', 'An odd capture that has some technical merit, but from an artistic standpoint does not quite match. A longer tracking shot would have helped this in a lot of ways. A larger image evoking a sense of speed, space and time would also have helped. A good entry into the challenge.', '2009-04-16 23:23:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5441260, 782353, 101256, '<td valign="top">Simple and effective, the sky could have used a little more treatment increasing the dramatic nature of this image. A very nice grayscale image, it does suffer a little bit from being flat in tone. A little more use of the zone system in adjusting brightness and contrast would have helped a lot. A good solid entry into the challenge.</td>', 'Simple and effective, the sky could have used a little more treatment increasing the dramatic nature of this image. A very nice grayscale image, it does suffer a little bit from being flat in tone. A little more use of the zone system in adjusting brightness and contrast would have helped a lot. A good solid entry into the challenge.', '2009-04-16 23:25:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5441264, 782311, 101256, '<td valign="top">Outstanding technical effort and a artistic success. Clever use of time and space to create a static yet dynamic sense of movement. There aren''t any major flaws to speak of - a very worthy entry into the challenge. Certainly a top twenty image.</td>', 'Outstanding technical effort and a artistic success. Clever use of time and space to create a static yet dynamic sense of movement. There aren''t any major flaws to speak of - a very worthy entry into the challenge. Certainly a top twenty image.', '2009-04-16 23:27:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5441273, 781739, 101256, '<td valign="top">A technical success from a capture standpoint, this image could have used a little more dramatic treatment in terms of tone. A different look at the subject matter and one worthy of consideration as a top twenty five image.</td>', 'A technical success from a capture standpoint, this image could have used a little more dramatic treatment in terms of tone. A different look at the subject matter and one worthy of consideration as a top twenty five image.', '2009-04-16 23:31:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5441277, 782332, 101256, '<td valign="top">A technical success and an artistic success, although a little less of a forced angle would have improved the image dramatically. A little more direct angle to the train would have eliminated the rather undramatic left side of the image and would have created much more impact.  A worthy entry into the challange.</td>', 'A technical success and an artistic success, although a little less of a forced angle would have improved the image dramatically. A little more direct angle to the train would have eliminated the rather undramatic left side of the image and would have created much more impact.  A worthy entry into the challange.', '2009-04-16 23:33:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5441283, 781898, 101256, '<td valign="top">A great angle and an unforced detail, this is in every sense a technical and artistic success. The perfect DOF control, crisp and sharp focus and excellant conversion to black and white make this a very worthy entry into the challenge and potentially a top ten finisher.</td>', 'A great angle and an unforced detail, this is in every sense a technical and artistic success. The perfect DOF control, crisp and sharp focus and excellant conversion to black and white make this a very worthy entry into the challenge and potentially a top ten finisher.', '2009-04-16 23:35:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5441288, 781679, 101256, '<td valign="top">Woulda, coulda, shoulda - the whites are just ever so over the edge which make it flawed technically, but from an artistic standpoint, this is a terrific image. For future reference, if the white blooms were turned down a little, the overall impact of this image would make it a top ten finisher and potential ribbon winnner.</td>', 'Woulda, coulda, shoulda - the whites are just ever so over the edge which make it flawed technically, but from an artistic standpoint, this is a terrific image. For future reference, if the white blooms were turned down a little, the overall impact of this image would make it a top ten finisher and potential ribbon winnner.', '2009-04-16 23:37:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5441296, 782302, 101256, '<td valign="top">A nice crisp, sharp image in which an unfortunate crop or capture with the extreme offset ruins the overall impact and all the non-engine space is distracting. From a technical standpoint, this is as good as it gets, but artistically, it fails to impart any sense of being about trains, etc. A good solid try, just falls a little short.</td>', 'A nice crisp, sharp image in which an unfortunate crop or capture with the extreme offset ruins the overall impact and all the non-engine space is distracting. From a technical standpoint, this is as good as it gets, but artistically, it fails to impart any sense of being about trains, etc. A good solid try, just falls a little short.', '2009-04-16 23:39:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5441360, 782277, 106006, '<td valign="top">this is great, however it is conceptual. this doesn''t coincide with the category. creative though.</td>', 'this is great, however it is conceptual. this doesn''t coincide with the category. creative though.', '2009-04-17 00:47:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5441376, 782161, 106006, '<td valign="top">B-E-A-U-T-I-F-U-L !</td>', 'B-E-A-U-T-I-F-U-L !', '2009-04-17 01:12:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5441377, 782228, 106006, '<td valign="top">perspective=great, colors/tone=kudos to you</td>', 'perspective=great, colors/tone=kudos to you', '2009-04-17 01:13:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5441378, 782396, 106006, '<td valign="top">whoa!  choo choo to you! luminating-tops!</td>', 'whoa!  choo choo to you! luminating-tops!', '2009-04-17 01:13:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5441379, 781177, 106006, '<td valign="top">feels as if i''m right there in reality feeling the vibrations and the wind of train about to pass me by.  phenomenal.</td>', 'feels as if i''m right there in reality feeling the vibrations and the wind of train about to pass me by.  phenomenal.', '2009-04-17 01:13:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5441381, 781664, 106006, '<td valign="top">lovin his facial expression. composition is right on.</td>', 'lovin his facial expression. composition is right on.', '2009-04-17 01:13:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5441418, 781068, 101430, '<td valign="top">this could have been cool. I just can''t really tell what the picture in the camera is of. I really like the idea though.</td>', 'this could have been cool. I just can''t really tell what the picture in the camera is of. I really like the idea though.', '2009-04-17 01:53:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5441419, 782277, 101430, '<td valign="top">ha.... ha.... ha.....</td>', 'ha.... ha.... ha.....', '2009-04-17 01:55:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5441516, 781452, 30982, '<td valign="top">I love the expansiveness of this - the green, the road, the city in the distance - and of course the red of the train and the tracks and the tunnel - great shot!</td>', 'I love the expansiveness of this - the green, the road, the city in the distance - and of course the red of the train and the tracks and the tunnel - great shot!', '2009-04-17 06:16:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5441517, 782040, 30982, '<td valign="top">I find it a bit sad that these old ones get "tagged" so poorly - always nicer when the artists take a bit more care with their work.  Good basic shot, but you may get dinged for the purple fringing going on - probably due to it being a bit brightish day as far as light.</td>', 'I find it a bit sad that these old ones get "tagged" so poorly - always nicer when the artists take a bit more care with their work.  Good basic shot, but you may get dinged for the purple fringing going on - probably due to it being a bit brightish day as far as light.', '2009-04-17 06:17:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5441518, 781328, 30982, '<td valign="top">This is so "last" as far as a stop, the power pole no longer has lines!  An average shot as far as DPC goes, but nice and clean, pretty good exposure.  The part I find interesting is the lack of power lines.  One wonders if the area is slated to just go back to nature, or there are other plans for it.</td>', 'This is so "last" as far as a stop, the power pole no longer has lines!  An average shot as far as DPC goes, but nice and clean, pretty good exposure.  The part I find interesting is the lack of power lines.  One wonders if the area is slated to just go back to nature, or there are other plans for it.', '2009-04-17 06:19:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5441519, 782140, 30982, '<td valign="top">Lovely location for the light!</td>', 'Lovely location for the light!', '2009-04-17 06:19:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5441521, 781723, 30982, '<td valign="top">Good use of perspective - trains are perfect for that sort of thing - and you found a great train, too!  I like the hint of a person in the window, and that black smoke against the sky.  Very well composed.</td>', 'Good use of perspective - trains are perfect for that sort of thing - and you found a great train, too!  I like the hint of a person in the window, and that black smoke against the sky.  Very well composed.', '2009-04-17 06:20:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5441522, 782170, 30982, '<td valign="top">While some may want more of the train, this shows the journey aspect quite nicely!</td>', 'While some may want more of the train, this shows the journey aspect quite nicely!', '2009-04-17 06:20:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5441523, 782351, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice effects - would probably work for nightmares as well!</td>', 'Nice effects - would probably work for nightmares as well!', '2009-04-17 06:22:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5441524, 782004, 30982, '<td valign="top">Beautiful train, lovely station, and the guy in the foreground is dressed to match (I''m guessing he''s an employee).  Nice light for this as well.</td>', 'Beautiful train, lovely station, and the guy in the foreground is dressed to match (I''m guessing he''s an employee).  Nice light for this as well.', '2009-04-17 06:23:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5441525, 780758, 30982, '<td valign="top">Perfect!  Great find for this challenge.</td>', 'Perfect!  Great find for this challenge.', '2009-04-17 06:23:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5441528, 782446, 30982, '<td valign="top">That''s quite the incline!!  Great subject for the challenge.  Technicals could be a bit stronger (kinda soft on focus, and if there was a way to compose to minimize that first light ficture, I think it would put more emphasis on the train.)</td>', 'That''s quite the incline!!  Great subject for the challenge.  Technicals could be a bit stronger (kinda soft on focus, and if there was a way to compose to minimize that first light ficture, I think it would put more emphasis on the train.)', '2009-04-17 06:26:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5441529, 782051, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice take on the challenge - love the tones, like the dynamic of the angle, and really like the trees in the left corner.</td>', 'Nice take on the challenge - love the tones, like the dynamic of the angle, and really like the trees in the left corner.', '2009-04-17 06:27:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5441531, 782356, 30982, '<td valign="top">Takes a minute to "see" this (for what it is).  Really like the light, color, and sense of motion conveyed.  Nice idea and execution!</td>', 'Takes a minute to "see" this (for what it is).  Really like the light, color, and sense of motion conveyed.  Nice idea and execution!', '2009-04-17 06:28:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5441543, 782223, 30982, '<td valign="top">Definitely like the person in this one.  Nicely composed!</td>', 'Definitely like the person in this one.  Nicely composed!', '2009-04-17 06:59:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5441544, 782228, 30982, '<td valign="top">Great use of the single rail and I love the old structures.  A good gray day shot.</td>', 'Great use of the single rail and I love the old structures.  A good gray day shot.', '2009-04-17 06:59:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5441548, 782184, 30982, '<td valign="top">One of the better ones I''ve seen so far in this challenge - glad you chose this one!  (Comment only, no vote.)</td>', 'One of the better ones I''ve seen so far in this challenge - glad you chose this one!  (Comment only, no vote.)', '2009-04-17 07:11:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5441568, 781160, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice light this time of day.  Hopefully this trestle isn''t used frequently - I''d hate to be where you were if a train decided to happen by - doesn''t look as though there''s anywhere to go!</td>', 'Nice light this time of day.  Hopefully this trestle isn''t used frequently - I''d hate to be where you were if a train decided to happen by - doesn''t look as though there''s anywhere to go!', '2009-04-17 07:47:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5441569, 782226, 30982, '<td valign="top">Heh - I like the Mona Lisa.  The train looks like an amusement park ride!</td>', 'Heh - I like the Mona Lisa.  The train looks like an amusement park ride!', '2009-04-17 07:47:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5441570, 782431, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like the lithographic kinda feel to this.</td>', 'I like the lithographic kinda feel to this.', '2009-04-17 07:48:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5441571, 782434, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very nice catch of the light, and good use of that red car behind as a backdrop.</td>', 'Very nice catch of the light, and good use of that red car behind as a backdrop.', '2009-04-17 07:49:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5441578, 782172, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice use of the lensbaby!</td>', 'Nice use of the lensbaby!', '2009-04-17 08:03:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5441579, 782067, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like the tones and perspective of this.  Like the feel of it, too.</td>', 'I like the tones and perspective of this.  Like the feel of it, too.', '2009-04-17 08:04:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5441580, 782163, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice evening light and long shadows.</td>', 'Nice evening light and long shadows.', '2009-04-17 08:04:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5441581, 781764, 30982, '<td valign="top">Excellent closeup!</td>', 'Excellent closeup!', '2009-04-17 08:05:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5441582, 782232, 30982, '<td valign="top">Yes, yes you are.  Love the way the light catches the track in the shadows.</td>', 'Yes, yes you are.  Love the way the light catches the track in the shadows.', '2009-04-17 08:05:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5441583, 782388, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very cool effect with the blur!  I like it.</td>', 'Very cool effect with the blur!  I like it.', '2009-04-17 08:06:40.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(5441584, 782076, 30982, '<td valign="top">Looks like it was once very elegant in its day.</td>', 'Looks like it was once very elegant in its day.', '2009-04-17 08:06:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5441586, 782057, 30982, '<td valign="top">Good title!  :-)  I like the shot, too.</td>', 'Good title!  :-)  I like the shot, too.', '2009-04-17 08:07:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5441587, 781536, 30982, '<td valign="top">Poor thing looks so lost and all alone there.  Has a very sad feel to it.</td>', 'Poor thing looks so lost and all alone there.  Has a very sad feel to it.', '2009-04-17 08:08:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5441588, 781389, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nicely desolate.</td>', 'Nicely desolate.', '2009-04-17 08:09:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5441589, 781148, 30982, '<td valign="top">Can''t beat that for framing!</td>', 'Can''t beat that for framing!', '2009-04-17 08:11:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5441668, 781735, 105938, '<td valign="top">Haha i go on that train every weekend</td>', 'Haha i go on that train every weekend', '2009-04-17 09:55:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5441703, 781641, 1569, '<td valign="top">Original prototype GM Volt.</td>', 'Original prototype GM Volt.', '2009-04-17 10:40:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5441750, 782371, 103309, '<td valign="top">simple photo with great composition. Shame the sky had nothing to offer...6</td>', 'simple photo with great composition. Shame the sky had nothing to offer...6', '2009-04-17 11:12:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5441768, 782371, 96823, '<td valign="top">The background is a little busy IMO.</td>', 'The background is a little busy IMO.', '2009-04-17 11:28:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5441770, 781384, 96823, '<td valign="top">Nicely done!</td>', 'Nicely done!', '2009-04-17 11:29:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5441771, 781962, 96823, '<td valign="top">Nicely done!</td>', 'Nicely done!', '2009-04-17 11:29:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5441782, 781735, 103309, '<td valign="top">very nice...not normally a fan of saturation but this works nicely</td>', 'very nice...not normally a fan of saturation but this works nicely', '2009-04-17 11:42:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5441784, 781974, 103309, '<td valign="top">very nice image...well done</td>', 'very nice image...well done', '2009-04-17 11:43:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5441788, 782224, 103309, '<td valign="top">cute....nice image</td>', 'cute....nice image', '2009-04-17 11:44:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5441791, 782051, 103309, '<td valign="top">beautiful...9</td>', 'beautiful...9', '2009-04-17 11:45:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5441795, 781869, 96823, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.</td>', 'Nice shot.', '2009-04-17 11:46:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5441801, 782434, 96823, '<td valign="top">Nicely done!</td>', 'Nicely done!', '2009-04-17 11:48:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5441806, 782203, 96823, '<td valign="top">Nicely done! But a tighter crop on the train may have been better. JMO!</td>', 'Nicely done! But a tighter crop on the train may have been better. JMO!', '2009-04-17 11:50:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5441808, 781739, 96823, '<td valign="top">Nicely done!</td>', 'Nicely done!', '2009-04-17 11:50:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5441811, 781778, 96823, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, the train shold have been more centered, and converted to B&amp;W. JMO!</td>', 'Nice shot, the train shold have been more centered, and converted to B&W. JMO!', '2009-04-17 11:55:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5441812, 781898, 96823, '<td valign="top">Nicely done!</td>', 'Nicely done!', '2009-04-17 11:56:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5441818, 782106, 96823, '<td valign="top">It''s a nice shot, but with the brightness of the photo you''ve lost some of the details in the clouds, adjusting the exposure. JMO</td>', 'It''s a nice shot, but with the brightness of the photo you''ve lost some of the details in the clouds, adjusting the exposure. JMO', '2009-04-17 12:00:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5441819, 782321, 96823, '<td valign="top">Nicely done!</td>', 'Nicely done!', '2009-04-17 12:00:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5441820, 781764, 101256, '<td valign="top">An interesting view point and one not normally seen. A very precise and crisp image somewhat flawed by it''s overly flat tonal appearance - it could have used a little better treatment with adding some contrast to increase it''s impact. The white areas are washed out and detail lost which isn''t a plus. It is a good concept and just a little on the short side in terms of execution. A good solid entry into the challenge and it should do reasonably well in terms of score.</td>', 'An interesting view point and one not normally seen. A very precise and crisp image somewhat flawed by it''s overly flat tonal appearance - it could have used a little better treatment with adding some contrast to increase it''s impact. The white areas are washed out and detail lost which isn''t a plus. It is a good concept and just a little on the short side in terms of execution. A good solid entry into the challenge and it should do reasonably well in terms of score.', '2009-04-17 12:01:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5441826, 781384, 101256, '<td valign="top">A very nice antique look to this image is a huge plus. Solid detail is also a plus. The temptation to boost the image by over sharpening was avoided and is a plus. The monotone approach with the slight color cast was a great choice. Unfortunately, the blank and unremarkable sky tends to overpower all the excellant work done in capturing the locomotive and the post processing effort. This is one image that could have done with a layer treatment to increase the washed look of the sky - might be worth revisiting just to see if it would work better. A good solid entry into the challenge.</td>', 'A very nice antique look to this image is a huge plus. Solid detail is also a plus. The temptation to boost the image by over sharpening was avoided and is a plus. The monotone approach with the slight color cast was a great choice. Unfortunately, the blank and unremarkable sky tends to overpower all the excellant work done in capturing the locomotive and the post processing effort. This is one image that could have done with a layer treatment to increase the washed look of the sky - might be worth revisiting just to see if it would work better. A good solid entry into the challenge.', '2009-04-17 12:05:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5441833, 782044, 101256, '<td valign="top">An excellant entry into the challenge that could have gone horribly wrong. This is one instance where the narrow foreground DOF actually enhances the image rather than subtracts from it. The various angles provide an interesting look into how architecture affects imagery. The combination of straight lines and angles is very pleasing to the eye. A unique entry and look into the challenge subject matter. A top twenty image and potentially a top ten. Well done.</td>', 'An excellant entry into the challenge that could have gone horribly wrong. This is one instance where the narrow foreground DOF actually enhances the image rather than subtracts from it. The various angles provide an interesting look into how architecture affects imagery. The combination of straight lines and angles is very pleasing to the eye. A unique entry and look into the challenge subject matter. A top twenty image and potentially a top ten. Well done.', '2009-04-17 12:08:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5441836, 782301, 101256, '<td valign="top">A terrific capture, although the color appears to be just a little flatter than it should be. The author did avoid the temptation to over sharpen which is a plus. The white could have been reduced to give the windows some more detail which in this type of linear capture, would have been a huge plus. Lots of interesting details to peruse and speculate on. A very worthy entry into the challenge and a potential top twenty image.</td>', 'A terrific capture, although the color appears to be just a little flatter than it should be. The author did avoid the temptation to over sharpen which is a plus. The white could have been reduced to give the windows some more detail which in this type of linear capture, would have been a huge plus. Lots of interesting details to peruse and speculate on. A very worthy entry into the challenge and a potential top twenty image.', '2009-04-17 12:11:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5441844, 782106, 101256, '<td valign="top">A great concept and very nicely executed. Unfortunately, the sky also hurts this image in a similar fashion to an earlier entry. It would have been vastly improved by bringing out the details in the sky to balance the image more effectively. Again, an image that could have gone horribly wrong, it''s almost at the break point between being brilliant and merely above average. A little more use of the zone system would have improved this tremendously. As it is, a very worthy entry into the challenge with top twenty potential.</td>', 'A great concept and very nicely executed. Unfortunately, the sky also hurts this image in a similar fashion to an earlier entry. It would have been vastly improved by bringing out the details in the sky to balance the image more effectively. Again, an image that could have gone horribly wrong, it''s almost at the break point between being brilliant and merely above average. A little more use of the zone system would have improved this tremendously. As it is, a very worthy entry into the challenge with top twenty potential.', '2009-04-17 12:18:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5441848, 782405, 101256, '<td valign="top">An image that suffers from an unfortunate crop. The skyline does nothing for the image and while the author''s intent is clear, it falls short of being properly executed. It might have worked better with a longer focal length, or perhaps a capture running along the lines of the tracks into the water using a DOF fade would have been a better choice. The image isn''t as crips or sharp as it should be. A good entry into the challenge that just falls short of being average.</td>', 'An image that suffers from an unfortunate crop. The skyline does nothing for the image and while the author''s intent is clear, it falls short of being properly executed. It might have worked better with a longer focal length, or perhaps a capture running along the lines of the tracks into the water using a DOF fade would have been a better choice. The image isn''t as crips or sharp as it should be. A good entry into the challenge that just falls short of being average.', '2009-04-17 12:21:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5441851, 782365, 101256, '<td valign="top">Sometimes a theme invokes a different idea or concept and this is clearly one of those images which meet the challenge subject in completely different fashion than one might normally expect. A great idea which falls short of perfection. The overally flat tones and color detracts from the subject''s impact. The DOF control is sound and effective. If this image could have been tone mapped, it would have helped tremendously and probably would have been a ribbon contender. A good solid entry into the challenge.</td>', 'Sometimes a theme invokes a different idea or concept and this is clearly one of those images which meet the challenge subject in completely different fashion than one might normally expect. A great idea which falls short of perfection. The overally flat tones and color detracts from the subject''s impact. The DOF control is sound and effective. If this image could have been tone mapped, it would have helped tremendously and probably would have been a ribbon contender. A good solid entry into the challenge.', '2009-04-17 12:25:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5441858, 781328, 101256, '<td valign="top">A good image that suffers from a flawed perspective. The author had the right idea, but the angle and the offset are not overly attractive to the viewer and does not invite closer inspection. A closer look at a different angle using bokeh and a little better lighting control might have been a better choice. At a minimum, the right side of this image should have been cropped out to reduce outside influences and attract the viewer to the subjet matter more effectively. A good entry into the challenge.</td>', 'A good image that suffers from a flawed perspective. The author had the right idea, but the angle and the offset are not overly attractive to the viewer and does not invite closer inspection. A closer look at a different angle using bokeh and a little better lighting control might have been a better choice. At a minimum, the right side of this image should have been cropped out to reduce outside influences and attract the viewer to the subjet matter more effectively. A good entry into the challenge.', '2009-04-17 12:29:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5441861, 782433, 101256, '<td valign="top">A terrific concept and a good close in image of the trucks of a railroad car. The lighting is a little harsh and a more controlled exposure to soften the light and increase the interest of the viewer would have been a huge plus and made this a perfect image.  As it is, it''s a good solid entry into the challenge and worthy of a top twenty finish. Well done.</td>', 'A terrific concept and a good close in image of the trucks of a railroad car. The lighting is a little harsh and a more controlled exposure to soften the light and increase the interest of the viewer would have been a huge plus and made this a perfect image.  As it is, it''s a good solid entry into the challenge and worthy of a top twenty finish. Well done.', '2009-04-17 12:31:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5441863, 781148, 101256, '<td valign="top">I had to return to this image because on the one hand, it''s a great concept and a different look at the challenge subject.  On the other hand, it suffers from a few unfortunate blemishes which, on initial review, were seen as negative. On the fourth pass, it now makes a much more favorable impression than at first. The framing, slight offset of the model and the concept of trains are all included in a great image. It might have helped to do a little crop at the top to increase the impact of the window view and model, but it works as it is. Well done.</td>', 'I had to return to this image because on the one hand, it''s a great concept and a different look at the challenge subject.  On the other hand, it suffers from a few unfortunate blemishes which, on initial review, were seen as negative. On the fourth pass, it now makes a much more favorable impression than at first. The framing, slight offset of the model and the concept of trains are all included in a great image. It might have helped to do a little crop at the top to increase the impact of the window view and model, but it works as it is. Well done.', '2009-04-17 12:36:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5441883, 781854, 101256, '<td valign="top">This is a great concept and from a technical perspective, a success. The image is right on the edge of being over sharpened which is a plus. This may have suffered from flash reflection as the silica in the rail bedding material creates a speckled effect similar to hot pixels even though that isn''t the problem - its very similar to what you get with snow in that the crystals reflect light at odd angles. From an artistic point of view, it falls just short of the mark of being excellant. A sound entry into the challenge and it should place well.</td>', 'This is a great concept and from a technical perspective, a success. The image is right on the edge of being over sharpened which is a plus. This may have suffered from flash reflection as the silica in the rail bedding material creates a speckled effect similar to hot pixels even though that isn''t the problem - its very similar to what you get with snow in that the crystals reflect light at odd angles. From an artistic point of view, it falls just short of the mark of being excellant. A sound entry into the challenge and it should place well.', '2009-04-17 12:54:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5441886, 782246, 101256, '<td valign="top">A very competant image of a passenger train, this image does not suffer from any major flaws and is a complete technical success. From an artistic standpoint, it fails to evoke any sort of interest or feeling either negative or positive. This image would be a good stock shot for use in a brochure or advertising material. A good entry into the challenge.</td>', 'A very competant image of a passenger train, this image does not suffer from any major flaws and is a complete technical success. From an artistic standpoint, it fails to evoke any sort of interest or feeling either negative or positive. This image would be a good stock shot for use in a brochure or advertising material. A good entry into the challenge.', '2009-04-17 12:56:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5441892, 781301, 101256, '<td valign="top">A great concept and a near perfect capture. The lighting could have been a little softer, but as it is, it works well. Both a technical and artistic success, this should placec high for it''s technical merit and artistic impact. Little minor issues are over shadowed by the reflections on the paint which add a nice little touch. A good solid entry into the challenge.</td>', 'A great concept and a near perfect capture. The lighting could have been a little softer, but as it is, it works well. Both a technical and artistic success, this should placec high for it''s technical merit and artistic impact. Little minor issues are over shadowed by the reflections on the paint which add a nice little touch. A good solid entry into the challenge.', '2009-04-17 13:04:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5441893, 782155, 101256, '<td valign="top">A great concept and a near perfect capture. The lighting could have been a little softer, but as it is, it works well. Both a technical and artistic success, this should place high for it''s technical merit and artistic impact. Little minor issues are over shadowed by the reflections which add a nice little touch. It could use a little better focus. A good solid entry into the challenge.</td>', 'A great concept and a near perfect capture. The lighting could have been a little softer, but as it is, it works well. Both a technical and artistic success, this should place high for it''s technical merit and artistic impact. Little minor issues are over shadowed by the reflections which add a nice little touch. It could use a little better focus. A good solid entry into the challenge.', '2009-04-17 13:05:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5441895, 782229, 101256, '<td valign="top">A great concept and a near perfect capture. The lighting could have been a little softer, but as it is, it works well. Both a technical and artistic success, this should place high for it''s technical merit and artistic impact. The image is a little small to provide a good look at theinteresting details. This would have been a better image in grayscale or black and white. A good solid entry into the challenge.</td>', 'A great concept and a near perfect capture. The lighting could have been a little softer, but as it is, it works well. Both a technical and artistic success, this should place high for it''s technical merit and artistic impact. The image is a little small to provide a good look at theinteresting details. This would have been a better image in grayscale or black and white. A good solid entry into the challenge.', '2009-04-17 13:06:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5441899, 782133, 101256, '<td valign="top">A good solid entry into the challenge with no major flaws. This could very well be a stock shot for a brochure or advertisement. A few minor flaws like being overly busy at the top, but the use of space is effecive. Little light blooms near the right center top are distracting. A good solid entry into the challenge.</td>', 'A good solid entry into the challenge with no major flaws. This could very well be a stock shot for a brochure or advertisement. A few minor flaws like being overly busy at the top, but the use of space is effecive. Little light blooms near the right center top are distracting. A good solid entry into the challenge.', '2009-04-17 13:09:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5441903, 781656, 101256, '<td valign="top">The lighting is a little too soft and the sky is flat which detracts from what could have been a top entry into the challenge. Just shy of being a technical and artistic success. A good solid entry into the challenge.</td>', 'The lighting is a little too soft and the sky is flat which detracts from what could have been a top entry into the challenge. Just shy of being a technical and artistic success. A good solid entry into the challenge.', '2009-04-17 13:11:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5441906, 781452, 101256, '<td valign="top">This image is both a technical and artistic success. The incredible highly detailed look of the background and the compare and contrast concept between height and depth is amazing. The color difference between foreground and background just increase it''s visual impact. This should place very high if not a ribbon winner. Well done.</td>', 'This image is both a technical and artistic success. The incredible highly detailed look of the background and the compare and contrast concept between height and depth is amazing. The color difference between foreground and background just increase it''s visual impact. This should place very high if not a ribbon winner. Well done.', '2009-04-17 13:13:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5441909, 782214, 101256, '<td valign="top">This is one time where the flatish sky works well with the overall concept. Nicely figured with plenty of detail, a great conversion to black and white, proper shade and tone control, this should rate highly and is a potential ribbon winner. One minor nitpick would be with the DOF - a little vagueness in the background would have helped a little, but it''s near perfect as it is. Well done.</td>', 'This is one time where the flatish sky works well with the overall concept. Nicely figured with plenty of detail, a great conversion to black and white, proper shade and tone control, this should rate highly and is a potential ribbon winner. One minor nitpick would be with the DOF - a little vagueness in the background would have helped a little, but it''s near perfect as it is. Well done.', '2009-04-17 13:15:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5441911, 782223, 101256, '<td valign="top">The unfortunate over sharpening hurts this image in a major way. A great concept and a good capture should have been left alone to stand on it''s own merits. There is a lot of impact here and from an artistic standpoint, it''s nearly perfect. Unfortunate.</td>', 'The unfortunate over sharpening hurts this image in a major way. A great concept and a good capture should have been left alone to stand on it''s own merits. There is a lot of impact here and from an artistic standpoint, it''s nearly perfect. Unfortunate.', '2009-04-17 13:18:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5441914, 781645, 101256, '<td valign="top">A great concept and a near perfect capture. The lighting could have been a little softer, but as it is, it works well. Again,, use of bokeh would have helped this image with the addition of a little vagueness in the background would have lifted this image out of above average rating. This needs to have more interest to be truly effective. A good solid entry into the challenge and a different look and perspective of the challenge subject.</td>', 'A great concept and a near perfect capture. The lighting could have been a little softer, but as it is, it works well. Again,, use of bokeh would have helped this image with the addition of a little vagueness in the background would have lifted this image out of above average rating. This needs to have more interest to be truly effective. A good solid entry into the challenge and a different look and perspective of the challenge subject.', '2009-04-17 13:20:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5441931, 780758, 103411, '<td valign="top">The reds here are really punchy, I like it.  Nice find with the graffiti.</td>', 'The reds here are really punchy, I like it.  Nice find with the graffiti.', '2009-04-17 13:45:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5441941, 781964, 103411, '<td valign="top">I do like this, but the border detracts here - 7, might have given 8 w/o border.</td>', 'I do like this, but the border detracts here - 7, might have given 8 w/o border.', '2009-04-17 13:49:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5441944, 782222, 103411, '<td valign="top">This is really cool, I love the grain and idea.</td>', 'This is really cool, I love the grain and idea.', '2009-04-17 13:50:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5441949, 781974, 103411, '<td valign="top">Great execution here to keep the train in focus, it must have been jetting pretty quickly.</td>', 'Great execution here to keep the train in focus, it must have been jetting pretty quickly.', '2009-04-17 13:51:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5441956, 781452, 103411, '<td valign="top">Is this a model with painting in the back or is this real and just over processed?  I don''t *love* the image but I can''t stop looking at it, trying to figure out exactly WHAT I am looking at.  Halos where the trees meet the blue background are distracting too.  All that said, 6 for confusing the heck out of me.</td>', 'Is this a model with painting in the back or is this real and just over processed?  I don''t *love* the image but I can''t stop looking at it, trying to figure out exactly WHAT I am looking at.  Halos where the trees meet the blue background are distracting too.  All that said, 6 for confusing the heck out of me.', '2009-04-17 13:56:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5441963, 781199, 103411, '<td valign="top">Not a bad idea but the halo around the train is distracting.. it''s kind of glowing.</td>', 'Not a bad idea but the halo around the train is distracting.. it''s kind of glowing.', '2009-04-17 14:00:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5441967, 782351, 103411, '<td valign="top">Don''t know if this will do well, but I like this.  The title is necessary or else it just looks out of focus.  With it, the image is jarring and alarming - good job.</td>', 'Don''t know if this will do well, but I like this.  The title is necessary or else it just looks out of focus.  With it, the image is jarring and alarming - good job.', '2009-04-17 14:08:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5441972, 781974, 99311, '<td valign="top">Excellent photo! Very sharp and vivid, excellent work of panning.. The yellow fields adds contrast to this photo.</td>', 'Excellent photo! Very sharp and vivid, excellent work of panning.. The yellow fields adds contrast to this photo.', '2009-04-17 14:13:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5441974, 782341, 99311, '<td valign="top">I like this photo.. somehow it looks a bit over saturated.</td>', 'I like this photo.. somehow it looks a bit over saturated.', '2009-04-17 14:14:23.000000', NULL, 1),
