(5442001, 782205, 83313, '<td valign="top">This shot has a very "Melethish" look to it. (I think I just invented an adjective.) <strike>If this is not <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=30982" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Melethia</a>''s entry, then please take it as a compliment.</strike> Ok, I just noticed the "Weisbaden" sign, so I am now 95% certain of it.</td>', 'This shot has a very "Melethish" look to it. (I think I just invented an adjective.) If this is not  Melethia''s entry, then please take it as a compliment. Ok, I just noticed the "Weisbaden" sign, so I am now 95% certain of it.', '2009-04-17 14:29:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5442005, 782278, 83313, '<td valign="top">I love Thomas. I first saw this show when I was stationed in the UK in the 80''s. It always irritated me that they felt the need to be politically correct when they brought this show to the US, and they renamed "The Fat Controller" to "Mr. Topham Hat"</td>', 'I love Thomas. I first saw this show when I was stationed in the UK in the 80''s. It always irritated me that they felt the need to be politically correct when they brought this show to the US, and they renamed "The Fat Controller" to "Mr. Topham Hat"', '2009-04-17 14:32:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5442007, 782380, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like the colors and slight wideangle view of this. A touch grainy on the details of the caboose, but not a huge problem. Really a nitpick.</td>', 'I like the colors and slight wideangle view of this. A touch grainy on the details of the caboose, but not a huge problem. Really a nitpick.', '2009-04-17 14:33:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5442008, 782233, 83313, '<td valign="top">A simple, but effective and strong b/w treatment.</td>', 'A simple, but effective and strong b/w treatment.', '2009-04-17 14:34:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5442009, 781471, 99311, '<td valign="top">Nice speia tone to this image ...</td>', 'Nice speia tone to this image ...', '2009-04-17 14:35:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5442010, 782434, 83313, '<td valign="top">Love those oily streaks. They really make this stand out. Faved.</td>', 'Love those oily streaks. They really make this stand out. Faved.', '2009-04-17 14:35:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5442012, 782353, 83313, '<td valign="top">So THAT''S what happened to old Nokl! I was wondering where he went to!<br/> <br/>I''m afraid this one stands out to me as a dead 5. Sorry. Nothing wrong with it at all. The composition is decent, the b/w conversion has good tones, but nothing really grabs my interest, either. I''m curious what the color version looks like.</td>', 'So THAT''S what happened to old Nokl! I was wondering where he went to! I''m afraid this one stands out to me as a dead 5. Sorry. Nothing wrong with it at all. The composition is decent, the b/w conversion has good tones, but nothing really grabs my interest, either. I''m curious what the color version looks like.', '2009-04-17 14:39:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5442014, 782357, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice way of making the usual distraction into the point of interest.</td>', 'Nice way of making the usual distraction into the point of interest.', '2009-04-17 14:40:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5442016, 782056, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice use of a strong sepia. I used to not care for sepia treatments, but then I recently found that I do like them when they are a bit on the strong side.</td>', 'Nice use of a strong sepia. I used to not care for sepia treatments, but then I recently found that I do like them when they are a bit on the strong side.', '2009-04-17 14:41:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5442017, 782222, 83313, '<td valign="top">The grain is probably hurting you on this one, though I do recognize it as an attempt to give this an old-timey feel to the shot.</td>', 'The grain is probably hurting you on this one, though I do recognize it as an attempt to give this an old-timey feel to the shot.', '2009-04-17 14:42:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5442019, 781680, 83313, '<td valign="top">Midday sun and the resulting strong shadows are the main thing that I think may hold this one down. I''ll bet at some other time of day you could get a nice gleam off those tracks and the brick would look gorgeous in the early evening sun.</td>', 'Midday sun and the resulting strong shadows are the main thing that I think may hold this one down. I''ll bet at some other time of day you could get a nice gleam off those tracks and the brick would look gorgeous in the early evening sun.', '2009-04-17 14:44:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5442023, 782410, 83313, '<td valign="top">Sorry, this shot just isn''t doing much for me. The nearly straight-on perspective and the way the left wheel is cropped out just does not work for me. I think form another angle this might show off the textures of the metal work quite well.</td>', 'Sorry, this shot just isn''t doing much for me. The nearly straight-on perspective and the way the left wheel is cropped out just does not work for me. I think form another angle this might show off the textures of the metal work quite well.', '2009-04-17 14:47:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5442024, 781328, 83313, '<td valign="top">Not sure on this. The boxcars have some nice detail, but it still seems to not quite have much visual impact to me.</td>', 'Not sure on this. The boxcars have some nice detail, but it still seems to not quite have much visual impact to me.', '2009-04-17 14:48:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5442033, 782420, 99311, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo.. I like the colour and the tone of this photo. The yellow and the red colour of the train contrasts well with the grey sky</td>', 'Very nice photo.. I like the colour and the tone of this photo. The yellow and the red colour of the train contrasts well with the grey sky', '2009-04-17 14:58:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5442078, 781721, 99506, '<td valign="top">Classic rail shot. Nice one.<br/>I keep returning to this shot, I really like that classic rail oil painting feel it has. This is now added to my favourites.</td>', 'Classic rail shot. Nice one.I keep returning to this shot, I really like that classic rail oil painting feel it has. This is now added to my favourites.', '2009-04-17 15:31:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5442098, 782057, 99411, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, but a little more imagination thought for the title would have helped</td>', 'Nice shot, but a little more imagination thought for the title would have helped', '2009-04-17 15:42:32.000000', NULL, 1),
