(5442227, 782140, 97954, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 10 and I love it but wonder about making it 8x12 format instead of 8x10 format - a little less square would be nice I think.</td>', 'I gave this a 10 and I love it but wonder about making it 8x12 format instead of 8x10 format - a little less square would be nice I think.', '2009-04-17 18:15:05.000000', NULL, 1),
