(5442279, 781177, 105333, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept but it''s a little dark</td>', 'Interesting concept but it''s a little dark', '2009-04-17 18:40:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5442283, 781680, 105333, '<td valign="top">The composition is lacking something for me.</td>', 'The composition is lacking something for me.', '2009-04-17 18:41:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5442289, 781068, 105333, '<td valign="top">The dark subject matter is not appealing to me</td>', 'The dark subject matter is not appealing to me', '2009-04-17 18:44:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5442398, 782044, 105274, '<td valign="top">I really like this photo because there is no clever photoshop changes (well none that I can see at a glance). This is what could have been a simple photo taken from an interesting angle that makes it a fantastic photo. I love the ones that dont involve too many changes to the original photo. Well done</td>', 'I really like this photo because there is no clever photoshop changes (well none that I can see at a glance). This is what could have been a simple photo taken from an interesting angle that makes it a fantastic photo. I love the ones that dont involve too many changes to the original photo. Well done', '2009-04-17 20:39:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5442448, 781940, 101256, '<td valign="top">A different and very interesting look at the infrastructure that trains run on. The DOF is well controlled, but a more compelling image might have been less extreme providing depth and dimension without hurting the concept. Good lighting and color control - the image is crisp and sharp. A solid entry into the challenge.</td>', 'A different and very interesting look at the infrastructure that trains run on. The DOF is well controlled, but a more compelling image might have been less extreme providing depth and dimension without hurting the concept. Good lighting and color control - the image is crisp and sharp. A solid entry into the challenge.', '2009-04-17 21:35:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5442454, 782403, 101256, '<td valign="top">Just one little tiny white space above the right side of the image is a minor flaw in an otherwise moody and purposeful image. The color is a very interesting shade of blue that one doesn''t often see - a kind of Williamsburg Blue and some of the slight color changes are very effective. A good solid entry into the challenge.</td>', 'Just one little tiny white space above the right side of the image is a minor flaw in an otherwise moody and purposeful image. The color is a very interesting shade of blue that one doesn''t often see - a kind of Williamsburg Blue and some of the slight color changes are very effective. A good solid entry into the challenge.', '2009-04-17 21:39:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5442456, 782226, 104010, '<td valign="top">Is that the Mona Lisa of street art I see in the left corner?</td>', 'Is that the Mona Lisa of street art I see in the left corner?', '2009-04-17 21:41:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5442458, 782350, 101256, '<td valign="top">The interesting combination of straight rail and architectural curves makes for a very pleasing image. The angle of the rail is unigue and something that is very much out of the ordinary providing a senes of depth and dimention not often seen in images like that. Good DOF control and almost perfect lighting. The background could be a little sharper, but it works as it is. A good solid entry into the challenge - both a technical and artistic success. Well done.</td>', 'The interesting combination of straight rail and architectural curves makes for a very pleasing image. The angle of the rail is unigue and something that is very much out of the ordinary providing a senes of depth and dimention not often seen in images like that. Good DOF control and almost perfect lighting. The background could be a little sharper, but it works as it is. A good solid entry into the challenge - both a technical and artistic success. Well done.', '2009-04-17 21:42:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5442461, 781148, 104010, '<td valign="top">Very original!</td>', 'Very original!', '2009-04-17 21:42:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5442466, 782334, 104010, '<td valign="top">Fantastic contrast!</td>', 'Fantastic contrast!', '2009-04-17 21:43:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5442468, 781127, 101256, '<td valign="top">Crisp and sharp, this image could have used a little bit more saturation to really make the colors pop. A nice dramatic sky set against the ridge line is a definite plus. The sense of proportion is excellant and well developed. A little more work on this using tone mapping would make it a very saleable image. A very worthy entry into the challenge and a potential top twenty image.</td>', 'Crisp and sharp, this image could have used a little bit more saturation to really make the colors pop. A nice dramatic sky set against the ridge line is a definite plus. The sense of proportion is excellant and well developed. A little more work on this using tone mapping would make it a very saleable image. A very worthy entry into the challenge and a potential top twenty image.', '2009-04-17 21:44:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5442469, 782446, 104010, '<td valign="top">A little more speed and you might want to make this railroad a part of the Walt Disney theme park! LOL!</td>', 'A little more speed and you might want to make this railroad a part of the Walt Disney theme park! LOL!', '2009-04-17 21:44:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5442474, 781745, 101256, '<td valign="top">Good DOF control, the color definition is good and the subject is different. Unfortunately, it seems a little flat and not totally appealing to the eye. It certainly approaches being an artistic success as well as a technical success, the image is just one of those images that needs something and that something cannot be specified. Having said that, it is a worthy entry into the challange and depending on other reviews, would be considered a top 30 image.</td>', 'Good DOF control, the color definition is good and the subject is different. Unfortunately, it seems a little flat and not totally appealing to the eye. It certainly approaches being an artistic success as well as a technical success, the image is just one of those images that needs something and that something cannot be specified. Having said that, it is a worthy entry into the challange and depending on other reviews, would be considered a top 30 image.', '2009-04-17 21:49:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5442482, 781644, 101256, '<td valign="top">A very good concept and a very good image. The sky seems a little over saturated creating a little less dramatic presence to match the chrome and detail of the rail car. Looking at this a third time, this reviewer was attempting to determine if there was an oversharpened condition, but apparently that''s not the issue with the jagged lines seen along the rail car. That is a production artifact due to compression loss and as such should not count against the image. A very worthy entry into the challenge.</td>', 'A very good concept and a very good image. The sky seems a little over saturated creating a little less dramatic presence to match the chrome and detail of the rail car. Looking at this a third time, this reviewer was attempting to determine if there was an oversharpened condition, but apparently that''s not the issue with the jagged lines seen along the rail car. That is a production artifact due to compression loss and as such should not count against the image. A very worthy entry into the challenge.', '2009-04-17 21:53:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5442487, 781543, 101256, '<td valign="top">While a unique look at the ravages of age on machinery, this image is much to bland to be an effective presentation. A little more thought as to background, shooting angle and proper color and background control would have made this image powerful, intense and dramatic which the subject matter certainly deserves. While a good image from a concept standpoint, and it does match the challenge, it falls short of a really good effort.</td>', 'While a unique look at the ravages of age on machinery, this image is much to bland to be an effective presentation. A little more thought as to background, shooting angle and proper color and background control would have made this image powerful, intense and dramatic which the subject matter certainly deserves. While a good image from a concept standpoint, and it does match the challenge, it falls short of a really good effort.', '2009-04-17 21:56:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5442494, 782056, 101256, '<td valign="top">A compelling image, the gentle tone shift and color cast is a brilliant choice to match the detailed subject matter. The gentle shift in tone from the subject to the sky is excellant and the slightly different angle is unique and very effective. This is a ribbon winner and possibly a blue ribbon - an extremely effective image. Well done.</td>', 'A compelling image, the gentle tone shift and color cast is a brilliant choice to match the detailed subject matter. The gentle shift in tone from the subject to the sky is excellant and the slightly different angle is unique and very effective. This is a ribbon winner and possibly a blue ribbon - an extremely effective image. Well done.', '2009-04-17 22:00:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5442506, 781505, 101256, '<td valign="top">A terrific concept and sound execution the difference between the streaking train and linear rails are striking and unique. The highlights are right on the edge which is a positive. It is interesting that there is great detail in the light which is different. A good solid entry into the challenge and a potential top twenty image.</td>', 'A terrific concept and sound execution the difference between the streaking train and linear rails are striking and unique. The highlights are right on the edge which is a positive. It is interesting that there is great detail in the light which is different. A good solid entry into the challenge and a potential top twenty image.', '2009-04-17 22:15:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5442508, 782039, 101256, '<td valign="top">A good concept and monotone treatment is a plus. Unfortunately, the over lighted condition on the locomotive is not well controlled affecting the image''s impact. Not a technical success while being right on the edge of being an artistic success. The angle of the image is different. A good entry into the challenge.</td>', 'A good concept and monotone treatment is a plus. Unfortunately, the over lighted condition on the locomotive is not well controlled affecting the image''s impact. Not a technical success while being right on the edge of being an artistic success. The angle of the image is different. A good entry into the challenge.', '2009-04-17 22:17:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5442516, 782272, 101256, '<td valign="top">Similar in concept to an earlier image, it does not quite impact the viewer in a positive way. The right on the edge whites are a plus and the two empty rails provide some contrast to match the train movement. A technical success. From an artistic standpoint, it has some positive elements, but just doesn''t have the pop that invites the viewer to revist and look for more detail. A good entry into the challenge.</td>', 'Similar in concept to an earlier image, it does not quite impact the viewer in a positive way. The right on the edge whites are a plus and the two empty rails provide some contrast to match the train movement. A technical success. From an artistic standpoint, it has some positive elements, but just doesn''t have the pop that invites the viewer to revist and look for more detail. A good entry into the challenge.', '2009-04-17 22:21:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5442518, 781471, 101256, '<td valign="top">A very postive piece recreating an earlier time when walking the rails was a common method of traveling to other places. The slight color cast is a plus and the over all feel is of an antique linotype. A very unique and different look at the challenge subject. Both a technical and artistic success. A certain top ten image and potential ribbon winner. Well done.</td>', 'A very postive piece recreating an earlier time when walking the rails was a common method of traveling to other places. The slight color cast is a plus and the over all feel is of an antique linotype. A very unique and different look at the challenge subject. Both a technical and artistic success. A certain top ten image and potential ribbon winner. Well done.', '2009-04-17 22:23:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5442519, 782076, 101256, '<td valign="top">A very good concept, it fails from being just that side of crisp and sharp. A little more time composing the image and getting the best shot from a focus standpoint would have been a plus. The linear shape of the car and the subtle curves of the ceiling are a plus. A very solid entry into the challenge, it suffers from an indistinct window view and slightly over done whites on the car''s floor.</td>', 'A very good concept, it fails from being just that side of crisp and sharp. A little more time composing the image and getting the best shot from a focus standpoint would have been a plus. The linear shape of the car and the subtle curves of the ceiling are a plus. A very solid entry into the challenge, it suffers from an indistinct window view and slightly over done whites on the car''s floor.', '2009-04-17 22:26:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5442520, 782336, 101256, '<td valign="top">A good idea, but over saturated steel supports, the overly darkened structure shot against a flat sky wash out any interesting details and do not affect the image in a positive way. It is a unique angle and presentation which is a positive, but the execution is lacking in both a technical and artistic sense.</td>', 'A good idea, but over saturated steel supports, the overly darkened structure shot against a flat sky wash out any interesting details and do not affect the image in a positive way. It is a unique angle and presentation which is a positive, but the execution is lacking in both a technical and artistic sense.', '2009-04-17 22:29:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5442524, 781332, 101256, '<td valign="top">An excellant image which could very well be a demonstration on how to compose and capture an image with detail, varying angles and a host of soft gentle color. One of the best reviewed so far, it should be considered a top ten image and a heavy favorite for a ribbon. Well done.</td>', 'An excellant image which could very well be a demonstration on how to compose and capture an image with detail, varying angles and a host of soft gentle color. One of the best reviewed so far, it should be considered a top ten image and a heavy favorite for a ribbon. Well done.', '2009-04-17 22:31:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5442527, 781664, 101256, '<td valign="top">An excellant example of composition, this image evokes an earlier time and place. A good solid conversion which could have used a little more difference in contrast between tones and slightly more control on brightness. Despite some minor issues, this image is a technical success and a highly effective artistic success. Well done.<br/> <br/>PS: While the clothes and hat evoke an earlier time and feel, the velcro strapped tennis shoes are an anachronism. :&gt;)  Yeah, it''s picky. :&gt;)</td>', 'An excellant example of composition, this image evokes an earlier time and place. A good solid conversion which could have used a little more difference in contrast between tones and slightly more control on brightness. Despite some minor issues, this image is a technical success and a highly effective artistic success. Well done. PS: While the clothes and hat evoke an earlier time and feel, the velcro strapped tennis shoes are an anachronism. :>)  Yeah, it''s picky. :>)', '2009-04-17 22:36:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5442530, 782233, 101256, '<td valign="top">A excellant conversion to black and white, this image is both a technical and artistic success. One minor nit pick is that the sky could be a little more dramatic, but adjusting for that would be outside the challenge parameters. It might be worthwhile revisiting this with an eye towards a local print competition. Well done.</td>', 'A excellant conversion to black and white, this image is both a technical and artistic success. One minor nit pick is that the sky could be a little more dramatic, but adjusting for that would be outside the challenge parameters. It might be worthwhile revisiting this with an eye towards a local print competition. Well done.', '2009-04-17 22:37:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5442537, 782410, 101256, '<td valign="top">A little better lighting control reducing the highlights would have been a plus. Not an overly interesting image from an artistic sense, it does provide a lot of detail and color differences. A little more thought into the composition would have made for a better image. A good entry into the challenge, it falls just short of being truly effective. Perhaps a little change in viewing angle or use of a light board to add some back lighting into the subject would have helped.</td>', 'A little better lighting control reducing the highlights would have been a plus. Not an overly interesting image from an artistic sense, it does provide a lot of detail and color differences. A little more thought into the composition would have made for a better image. A good entry into the challenge, it falls just short of being truly effective. Perhaps a little change in viewing angle or use of a light board to add some back lighting into the subject would have helped.', '2009-04-17 22:46:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5442543, 782163, 101256, '<td valign="top">A terrific demonstration of how to capture motion and detail at the same time. A nearly perfect conversion to black and white, the image is strong, purposeful and provocative causing the viewer to look closely at the image and discover more detail. A well thought out image with a couple of minor flaws that only an extremely picky reviewer would even think of looking for. A very worthy ribbon contender. Well done.</td>', 'A terrific demonstration of how to capture motion and detail at the same time. A nearly perfect conversion to black and white, the image is strong, purposeful and provocative causing the viewer to look closely at the image and discover more detail. A well thought out image with a couple of minor flaws that only an extremely picky reviewer would even think of looking for. A very worthy ribbon contender. Well done.', '2009-04-17 22:49:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5442545, 781709, 101256, '<td valign="top">Not quite a technical success due to unfortunate white highlights. Solid and effective tone control on the sepia conversion. While a fairly common angle for this type of image, the slightly different height is a plus. If the lighting and highlights had been better controlled, this would have been a ribbon contender. A good solid entry into the challenge.</td>', 'Not quite a technical success due to unfortunate white highlights. Solid and effective tone control on the sepia conversion. While a fairly common angle for this type of image, the slightly different height is a plus. If the lighting and highlights had been better controlled, this would have been a ribbon contender. A good solid entry into the challenge.', '2009-04-17 22:51:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5442546, 782356, 101256, '<td valign="top">A brilliant concept and perfectly executed. Initially, the image looks like an object lying against a colored wall, but then the eye shifts and it''s perspective is revealed. Simply a wonderful idea. The author should be very proud of this image because of it''s technical and artistic success. If there were a DPC Hall of Fame, this would be a worthy image to enter. Well done - a blue ribbon if there is any justice in the world. :&gt;)</td>', 'A brilliant concept and perfectly executed. Initially, the image looks like an object lying against a colored wall, but then the eye shifts and it''s perspective is revealed. Simply a wonderful idea. The author should be very proud of this image because of it''s technical and artistic success. If there were a DPC Hall of Fame, this would be a worthy image to enter. Well done - a blue ribbon if there is any justice in the world. :>)', '2009-04-17 22:54:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5442572, 782222, 101256, '<td valign="top">A very antique look is a huge plus. While the white streaking could be viewed as a negative, it adds to the image as these types of flaws were very common on glass negative plates. A very unique look at the subject matter, this will surely be a ribbon contender if only for it''s perfectly executed concept. An artistic and technical success in every sense. Well done.</td>', 'A very antique look is a huge plus. While the white streaking could be viewed as a negative, it adds to the image as these types of flaws were very common on glass negative plates. A very unique look at the subject matter, this will surely be a ribbon contender if only for it''s perfectly executed concept. An artistic and technical success in every sense. Well done.', '2009-04-17 23:05:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5442575, 782182, 101256, '<td valign="top">A little better lighting control reducing the highlights would have been a plus. Not an overly interesting image from an artistic sense, it does provide a lot of detail and color differences. A little more thought into the composition would have made for a better image. A good entry into the challenge, it falls just short of being truly effective. Perhaps a little change in viewing angle would have helped.</td>', 'A little better lighting control reducing the highlights would have been a plus. Not an overly interesting image from an artistic sense, it does provide a lot of detail and color differences. A little more thought into the composition would have made for a better image. A good entry into the challenge, it falls just short of being truly effective. Perhaps a little change in viewing angle would have helped.', '2009-04-17 23:07:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5442582, 782277, 101256, '<td valign="top">Laugh out loud funny and so totally outside the box that it has to be rated a ten just for the whimsy and clever title. A little over active in the imagination department is a huge plus. Not quite matching the challenge subject, it none the less is a welcome moment of levity and jocularity. Very well done.</td>', 'Laugh out loud funny and so totally outside the box that it has to be rated a ten just for the whimsy and clever title. A little over active in the imagination department is a huge plus. Not quite matching the challenge subject, it none the less is a welcome moment of levity and jocularity. Very well done.', '2009-04-17 23:09:35.000000', NULL, 1),
