(5442686, 781679, 5822, '<td valign="top">I like the setting, subject, and composition, but not the garish colors.</td>', 'I like the setting, subject, and composition, but not the garish colors.', '2009-04-18 01:58:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5442689, 782277, 5822, '<td valign="top">Im sure many a bride will rail against this image.</td>', 'Im sure many a bride will rail against this image.', '2009-04-18 02:01:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5442692, 781964, 5822, '<td valign="top">I like this concept alot but think it could have been carried out better. For one thing, I would like to see the engineer''s face better. Also, wish there was more detail in the train and not so much dead space to the left.</td>', 'I like this concept alot but think it could have been carried out better. For one thing, I would like to see the engineer''s face better. Also, wish there was more detail in the train and not so much dead space to the left.', '2009-04-18 02:05:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5442708, 782044, 5822, '<td valign="top">Would have liked better if the near yellow foreground was in focus. It would have had more impact for me.</td>', 'Would have liked better if the near yellow foreground was in focus. It would have had more impact for me.', '2009-04-18 02:18:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5442711, 782342, 5822, '<td valign="top">wish that break in the wall wasn''t there. It''s kind of distracting.</td>', 'wish that break in the wall wasn''t there. It''s kind of distracting.', '2009-04-18 02:22:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5442717, 781869, 5822, '<td valign="top">Cool photo!</td>', 'Cool photo!', '2009-04-18 02:26:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5442783, 781974, 86799, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  The color bands set off the silver and white, and the detail is sharp and clear.  Defines "speedy".  Good work.</td>', 'Very nice.  The color bands set off the silver and white, and the detail is sharp and clear.  Defines "speedy".  Good work.', '2009-04-18 07:50:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5442784, 781723, 86799, '<td valign="top">Good old-timey feel to it.  And the shot of red on the front is a real leader.  Well done.</td>', 'Good old-timey feel to it.  And the shot of red on the front is a real leader.  Well done.', '2009-04-18 07:52:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5442785, 781505, 86799, '<td valign="top">Smooth.  Well done.</td>', 'Smooth.  Well done.', '2009-04-18 07:53:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5442788, 782334, 86799, '<td valign="top">Interesting, colorful contrast.</td>', 'Interesting, colorful contrast.', '2009-04-18 07:55:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5442790, 781664, 86799, '<td valign="top">Has a 30s hobo feel to it...except for the velcro tennis shoes.  Ha!  Very nice.</td>', 'Has a 30s hobo feel to it...except for the velcro tennis shoes.  Ha!  Very nice.', '2009-04-18 07:57:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5442791, 782184, 86799, '<td valign="top">I came back to comment and bumped this one.  The subtle, sharp detail and huge clouds of steam are wonderful on this shot.  The viewer can almost hear the whistles and bells and clanks and creaks.  This shouts.</td>', 'I came back to comment and bumped this one.  The subtle, sharp detail and huge clouds of steam are wonderful on this shot.  The viewer can almost hear the whistles and bells and clanks and creaks.  This shouts.', '2009-04-18 08:00:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5442793, 780740, 86799, '<td valign="top">Good color.  Not sure about your vert and horiz.  I see the 1st full stripe on the left is vert, but then your lettering on top is off.  How does it look if you set your letters horiz and let the stripes fall where they may...</td>', 'Good color.  Not sure about your vert and horiz.  I see the 1st full stripe on the left is vert, but then your lettering on top is off.  How does it look if you set your letters horiz and let the stripes fall where they may...', '2009-04-18 08:02:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5442794, 781127, 86799, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, peaceful...anticipating the arrival of steam and noise.  Cool shot.</td>', 'Beautiful, peaceful...anticipating the arrival of steam and noise.  Cool shot.', '2009-04-18 08:03:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5442795, 781964, 86799, '<td valign="top">Can you bring out the face just a little bit more?  Great shot, but it keeps me wanting to see his face better.</td>', 'Can you bring out the face just a little bit more?  Great shot, but it keeps me wanting to see his face better.', '2009-04-18 08:05:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5442798, 782202, 67258, '<td valign="top">The angle you have taken the photo at suits the subject well, but the photo doesn''t really work for me.  The shadows on the walls are a little distracting, and the processing has resulted in some obvious haloing. Given the museum exhibit type setting, I wonder if a better choice might have been to go in much closer and pick out some interesting detail in the wheels or funnel?</td>', 'The angle you have taken the photo at suits the subject well, but the photo doesn''t really work for me.  The shadows on the walls are a little distracting, and the processing has resulted in some obvious haloing. Given the museum exhibit type setting, I wonder if a better choice might have been to go in much closer and pick out some interesting detail in the wheels or funnel?', '2009-04-18 08:12:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5442799, 782229, 67258, '<td valign="top">On my screen at work this is so dark as to be unviewable, with a strange fuzziness around the crane; on my home monitor there is some detail, but it is not a strong monotone conversion.  The composition seems a bit one-sided, with little of interest in the left hand side of the frame.</td>', 'On my screen at work this is so dark as to be unviewable, with a strange fuzziness around the crane; on my home monitor there is some detail, but it is not a strong monotone conversion.  The composition seems a bit one-sided, with little of interest in the left hand side of the frame.', '2009-04-18 08:14:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5442800, 781579, 67258, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting scene, and your choice of processing reflects the idea of yesteryear.  I would have cropped the white carriage immediately to the left of the frame out, as it rather draws the eye.  I am unsure whether the softness is deliberate, but personally I feel that for this photo a little sharper focus/p-p would have been beneficial.</td>', 'This is an interesting scene, and your choice of processing reflects the idea of yesteryear.  I would have cropped the white carriage immediately to the left of the frame out, as it rather draws the eye.  I am unsure whether the softness is deliberate, but personally I feel that for this photo a little sharper focus/p-p would have been beneficial.', '2009-04-18 08:17:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5442803, 782052, 67258, '<td valign="top">This is a really good concept, but let down in it''s execution by the over-exposure to the left .  The composition is good, and careful thought has clearly gone into it with the placement of the various lead-in lines.</td>', 'This is a really good concept, but let down in it''s execution by the over-exposure to the left .  The composition is good, and careful thought has clearly gone into it with the placement of the various lead-in lines.', '2009-04-18 08:20:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5442804, 781964, 67258, '<td valign="top">Back to comment.  This is one of the stronger entries.  The idea is good, but there is perhaps a bit too much steam - in an ideal world you would have cauht the engine driver where there is a break in the steam, and the photo is just a little too dark for my tastes.  That said, it is up there in my top 5 of the challenge.</td>', 'Back to comment.  This is one of the stronger entries.  The idea is good, but there is perhaps a bit too much steam - in an ideal world you would have cauht the engine driver where there is a break in the steam, and the photo is just a little too dark for my tastes.  That said, it is up there in my top 5 of the challenge.', '2009-04-18 08:23:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5442805, 782321, 67258, '<td valign="top">Good perspective - gives the impression of mass, power and strength.</td>', 'Good perspective - gives the impression of mass, power and strength.', '2009-04-18 08:23:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5442806, 782301, 67258, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot with well controlled exposure.  The composition is good - and tricky in such a confined space, too.</td>', 'Interesting shot with well controlled exposure.  The composition is good - and tricky in such a confined space, too.', '2009-04-18 08:24:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5442808, 781764, 67258, '<td valign="top">one of the strongest entries in the challenge.  A thoroughly interesting image, well composed with a good monotone conversion that displays the textures well.</td>', 'one of the strongest entries in the challenge.  A thoroughly interesting image, well composed with a good monotone conversion that displays the textures well.', '2009-04-18 08:25:39.000000', NULL, 1),
