(5444007, 782172, 101256, '<td valign="top">Crisp and sharp which is a major plus and a very interesting use of DOF.  Lots of details, good angle which could have been a little lower, but it fine as it is. The author took time to do the best job in difficult lighting. The lights are right on the edge of being overdone. A unique and interesting look using a very inventive and different technique. A top twenty image with top ten potential.</td>', 'Crisp and sharp which is a major plus and a very interesting use of DOF.  Lots of details, good angle which could have been a little lower, but it fine as it is. The author took time to do the best job in difficult lighting. The lights are right on the edge of being overdone. A unique and interesting look using a very inventive and different technique. A top twenty image with top ten potential.', '2009-04-19 17:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444008, 782265, 81618, '<td valign="top">nice simple composition composition. Lovely toned image.</td>', 'nice simple composition composition. Lovely toned image.', '2009-04-19 17:57:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444009, 782342, 101256, '<td valign="top">Crisp and sharp which is a major plus - a good grayscale.  Lots of details, good angle which shows off the linear nature of the times and roof, but keeping the curving sweep into the distance. The author took time to do the best job in difficult lighting as the highlights are right on the edge of being over done. Unfortunately, it could have used some more "action" and if the author had taken a little more time to catch a sense of speed with the oncoming train, along with reducing the foreground tile flares, it would have been perfect. Well done.</td>', 'Crisp and sharp which is a major plus - a good grayscale.  Lots of details, good angle which shows off the linear nature of the times and roof, but keeping the curving sweep into the distance. The author took time to do the best job in difficult lighting as the highlights are right on the edge of being over done. Unfortunately, it could have used some more "action" and if the author had taken a little more time to catch a sense of speed with the oncoming train, along with reducing the foreground tile flares, it would have been perfect. Well done.', '2009-04-19 18:00:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444014, 781700, 101256, '<td valign="top">Crisp and sharp which is a major plus.  Lots of details, good angle which shows off the linear nature of the times and roof, but showing off the squarish shape of the curves of the building face. The author took time to do the best job in difficult lighting as the highlights are right on the edge of being over done. Unfortunately, the saturation is underwhelming and with the flat undetailed sky, it is not as attractive as it could have been. A worthy entry into the challenge.</td>', 'Crisp and sharp which is a major plus.  Lots of details, good angle which shows off the linear nature of the times and roof, but showing off the squarish shape of the curves of the building face. The author took time to do the best job in difficult lighting as the highlights are right on the edge of being over done. Unfortunately, the saturation is underwhelming and with the flat undetailed sky, it is not as attractive as it could have been. A worthy entry into the challenge.', '2009-04-19 18:02:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444019, 782126, 101256, '<td valign="top">There is always a temptation to over critique an image where the author attempted to pull off a good idea, but lost sight of the technical problems being faced in the effort. Shooting into bright light from a dark area is always tricky and in this case, fell short. The overall image is flat and all the unique details inherent in the passengers and station conductor is lost against the flat undetailed sky. This might have worked better shooting into the dark from the edge of the light rather than vice versa.</td>', 'There is always a temptation to over critique an image where the author attempted to pull off a good idea, but lost sight of the technical problems being faced in the effort. Shooting into bright light from a dark area is always tricky and in this case, fell short. The overall image is flat and all the unique details inherent in the passengers and station conductor is lost against the flat undetailed sky. This might have worked better shooting into the dark from the edge of the light rather than vice versa.', '2009-04-19 18:14:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444022, 782067, 101256, '<td valign="top">Lots of details, good angle which shows off the linear nature of the station supports and roof. Unfortunately, it could have used some more tension by getting a little closer to the passenger staring at the wall. The image could have used a little better crop keeping the entire image in sharp relief rather than the fade - the DOF fade doesn''t quite work well in this image. The overall monotone to the image works well. A good entry into the challenge.</td>', 'Lots of details, good angle which shows off the linear nature of the station supports and roof. Unfortunately, it could have used some more tension by getting a little closer to the passenger staring at the wall. The image could have used a little better crop keeping the entire image in sharp relief rather than the fade - the DOF fade doesn''t quite work well in this image. The overall monotone to the image works well. A good entry into the challenge.', '2009-04-19 18:19:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444029, 781515, 101256, '<td valign="top">A great idea that matches the title well. A little more DOF control would have made this a much better image and conveyed the nature of the subject matter more effectively. The focused area is perfectly detailed and the ambient light very well managed, but the short focus detracts from it''s overall impact. Certainly a worthy effort in the challenge and if the DOF effect had been made better use of, it would have been a top ten image and a possible ribbon winner.</td>', 'A great idea that matches the title well. A little more DOF control would have made this a much better image and conveyed the nature of the subject matter more effectively. The focused area is perfectly detailed and the ambient light very well managed, but the short focus detracts from it''s overall impact. Certainly a worthy effort in the challenge and if the DOF effect had been made better use of, it would have been a top ten image and a possible ribbon winner.', '2009-04-19 18:22:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444032, 781744, 101256, '<td valign="top">A good concept and a very nicely composed image. It could have used a better crop taking off at least the top third of the image to concentrate the viewer''s eye onto the subject. Good effective use of DOF. A very clever look at the challenge subject - well done.</td>', 'A good concept and a very nicely composed image. It could have used a better crop taking off at least the top third of the image to concentrate the viewer''s eye onto the subject. Good effective use of DOF. A very clever look at the challenge subject - well done.', '2009-04-19 18:24:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444037, 782065, 101256, '<td valign="top">Intriguing and out of the ordinary. The sky could have used a better treatment, but the focused areas a sharp, crisp and well detailed. A good idea and from a technical standpoint, well handled. Artistically, it falls short of being completely interesting inviting the viewer to observe more of what the author captured - not a lot of visual impact. Perhaps a little more motion would have helped to create some more interest.</td>', 'Intriguing and out of the ordinary. The sky could have used a better treatment, but the focused areas a sharp, crisp and well detailed. A good idea and from a technical standpoint, well handled. Artistically, it falls short of being completely interesting inviting the viewer to observe more of what the author captured - not a lot of visual impact. Perhaps a little more motion would have helped to create some more interest.', '2009-04-19 18:26:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444039, 782369, 101256, '<td valign="top">From a technical standpoint, this is a terrific effort - crisp, sharp with everything detail well controlled and captured. From an artistic standpoint, it''s rather bland and uninviting to the viewer. Sometimes an image, even one as technically competant as this one is, is just an image. A worthy entry into the challenge and directly related to the challenge subject. A good effort falling short in the artistic sense.</td>', 'From a technical standpoint, this is a terrific effort - crisp, sharp with everything detail well controlled and captured. From an artistic standpoint, it''s rather bland and uninviting to the viewer. Sometimes an image, even one as technically competant as this one is, is just an image. A worthy entry into the challenge and directly related to the challenge subject. A good effort falling short in the artistic sense.', '2009-04-19 18:30:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444040, 781721, 101256, '<td valign="top">From a technical standpoint, this is a terrific effort - crisp, sharp with everything detail well controlled and captured. From an artistic standpoint, it''s rather bland and uninviting to the viewer. Sometimes an image, even one as technically competant as this one is, is just an image. A worthy entry into the challenge and directly related to the challenge subject. A good effort falling short in the artistic sense.</td>', 'From a technical standpoint, this is a terrific effort - crisp, sharp with everything detail well controlled and captured. From an artistic standpoint, it''s rather bland and uninviting to the viewer. Sometimes an image, even one as technically competant as this one is, is just an image. A worthy entry into the challenge and directly related to the challenge subject. A good effort falling short in the artistic sense.', '2009-04-19 18:30:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444043, 781941, 101256, '<td valign="top">A terrific look at the mechanicals of an old steam engine with a few minor flaws. The white highlights could have been better controlled - a little different angle away from the subject would possibly have helped with that. A very interesting change from light to dark and full of rich detail. The image appears to be a little less sharp that it could be. A good, sound effort both technically and artistically. A worthy entry into the challenge.</td>', 'A terrific look at the mechanicals of an old steam engine with a few minor flaws. The white highlights could have been better controlled - a little different angle away from the subject would possibly have helped with that. A very interesting change from light to dark and full of rich detail. The image appears to be a little less sharp that it could be. A good, sound effort both technically and artistically. A worthy entry into the challenge.', '2009-04-19 18:33:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444051, 780740, 101256, '<td valign="top">A unique and different look at the challenge subject, this is a perfect concept executed in fine fashion. A technical and artistic success with nothing to critique or call as a major, or even minor, flaw. This should be a ribbon winner as it''s very unique and well presented.</td>', 'A unique and different look at the challenge subject, this is a perfect concept executed in fine fashion. A technical and artistic success with nothing to critique or call as a major, or even minor, flaw. This should be a ribbon winner as it''s very unique and well presented.', '2009-04-19 18:41:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444053, 782372, 101256, '<td valign="top">This is one of those images where different top crops create seperate and very different images - very hard to comment on. From a technical standpoint it is nearly perfect - tones and highlights are extremely well controlled and the monotone effect with a light sepia touch is very effective. It is also an effective artistic effort that has a very minor issues like an ineffective and overly undetailed sky. A good solid effort which could be considered a top twenty image.</td>', 'This is one of those images where different top crops create seperate and very different images - very hard to comment on. From a technical standpoint it is nearly perfect - tones and highlights are extremely well controlled and the monotone effect with a light sepia touch is very effective. It is also an effective artistic effort that has a very minor issues like an ineffective and overly undetailed sky. A good solid effort which could be considered a top twenty image.', '2009-04-19 18:44:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444059, 782140, 101256, '<td valign="top">A great idea which is very difficult to pull off without some heavy post processing. The rail highlights are overdone which is a negative and maybe a by product of trying to capture or make the rays of light more distinct. While this image is technically flawed, it is a complete artistic success because it offers an ethereal feeling of time, space and dimension - it could very well be a noir book cover if done in black and white - which, come to think of it, might be something the author might want to consider just as an exercise to see if the image is improved. Sepia treatment might also be a good suggestion. The author should do themselves a favor and tinker with this using a post processor to see what happens - this image has a lot of potential if handled properly - a good print competition winner.</td>', 'A great idea which is very difficult to pull off without some heavy post processing. The rail highlights are overdone which is a negative and maybe a by product of trying to capture or make the rays of light more distinct. While this image is technically flawed, it is a complete artistic success because it offers an ethereal feeling of time, space and dimension - it could very well be a noir book cover if done in black and white - which, come to think of it, might be something the author might want to consider just as an exercise to see if the image is improved. Sepia treatment might also be a good suggestion. The author should do themselves a favor and tinker with this using a post processor to see what happens - this image has a lot of potential if handled properly - a good print competition winner.', '2009-04-19 18:49:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444061, 782439, 101256, '<td valign="top">Has somebody named these little guys yet?  How about Piney Stand or Tree Boy? This reviewer has seen these little guys in a variety of situations and the authors should make a series out of them. Terrific concept - the image is a little larger than necessary - a fun treatment might have been to get closer and use bokeh to some effect in a linear shot. A lot of whimsy and humor in this and this reviewer always appreciates whimsy and himor. A technical and artistic success.</td>', 'Has somebody named these little guys yet?  How about Piney Stand or Tree Boy? This reviewer has seen these little guys in a variety of situations and the authors should make a series out of them. Terrific concept - the image is a little larger than necessary - a fun treatment might have been to get closer and use bokeh to some effect in a linear shot. A lot of whimsy and humor in this and this reviewer always appreciates whimsy and himor. A technical and artistic success.', '2009-04-19 18:52:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444062, 782048, 101256, '<td valign="top">From a artistic standpoint, this is a terrific effort. From a technical standpoint, it''s rather bland and uninviting to the viewer as it seems to be slightly defocused and overly dark - a lighter treatment would have helped or even a grayscale conversion. Sometimes an image, even one as artistically competant as this one is, is just an image. A good effort falling short in the technical sense.</td>', 'From a artistic standpoint, this is a terrific effort. From a technical standpoint, it''s rather bland and uninviting to the viewer as it seems to be slightly defocused and overly dark - a lighter treatment would have helped or even a grayscale conversion. Sometimes an image, even one as artistically competant as this one is, is just an image. A good effort falling short in the technical sense.', '2009-04-19 18:54:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444069, 781177, 101256, '<td valign="top">A complete technical success with the highlights being right on the edge of overdone. The lens flare effect is also a plus with the light reflecting off the tracks. A little more effective crop concentrating on the image and lessening of the blank space would have positively affected the image from an artistic sense. A very unique and clever look at the challenge subject. Well one - could be a top ten if the image was a little more concentrated on the lights and their effects.</td>', 'A complete technical success with the highlights being right on the edge of overdone. The lens flare effect is also a plus with the light reflecting off the tracks. A little more effective crop concentrating on the image and lessening of the blank space would have positively affected the image from an artistic sense. A very unique and clever look at the challenge subject. Well one - could be a top ten if the image was a little more concentrated on the lights and their effects.', '2009-04-19 19:05:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444074, 782406, 101256, '<td valign="top">A beautiful image with plenty of color and rich detail. A very different look at the challenge subject. The background seems a little over saturated and unnatural which is a minor flaw and may be an comparison issue from the viewer''s standpoint. A technical success and most certainly an artistic success. Well done.</td>', 'A beautiful image with plenty of color and rich detail. A very different look at the challenge subject. The background seems a little over saturated and unnatural which is a minor flaw and may be an comparison issue from the viewer''s standpoint. A technical success and most certainly an artistic success. Well done.', '2009-04-19 19:09:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444077, 782380, 101256, '<td valign="top">A good image, good angle and an artistic success. The image does have an interesting green color cast to the tracks which is intriguing. The difficult lighting was handled effectively. It might have helped to turn the saturation down just a tad, but it''s fine as it is. No major technical flaws. A worthy entry into the challenge.</td>', 'A good image, good angle and an artistic success. The image does have an interesting green color cast to the tracks which is intriguing. The difficult lighting was handled effectively. It might have helped to turn the saturation down just a tad, but it''s fine as it is. No major technical flaws. A worthy entry into the challenge.', '2009-04-19 19:12:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444078, 781553, 101256, '<td valign="top">Occasionally, an image comes along that is so perfect, that to say anything at all would be to say too much. Well done - a ribbon winner.</td>', 'Occasionally, an image comes along that is so perfect, that to say anything at all would be to say too much. Well done - a ribbon winner.', '2009-04-19 19:13:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444080, 781852, 101256, '<td valign="top">From a technical standpoint, this is a terrific effort - crisp, sharp with everything detail well controlled and captured. From an artistic standpoint, it''s rather bland and uninviting to the viewer. Sometimes an image, even one as technically competant as this one is, is just an image. A worthy entry into the challenge and directly related to the challenge subject. A good effort falling short in the artistic sense.</td>', 'From a technical standpoint, this is a terrific effort - crisp, sharp with everything detail well controlled and captured. From an artistic standpoint, it''s rather bland and uninviting to the viewer. Sometimes an image, even one as technically competant as this one is, is just an image. A worthy entry into the challenge and directly related to the challenge subject. A good effort falling short in the artistic sense.', '2009-04-19 19:14:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444081, 781125, 101256, '<td valign="top">From a technical standpoint, this is a terrific effort - crisp, sharp with everything detail well controlled and captured. From an artistic standpoint, it''s rather bland and uninviting to the viewer. Sometimes an image, even one as technically competant as this one is, is just an image. A worthy entry into the challenge and directly related to the challenge subject. A good effort falling short in the artistic sense.</td>', 'From a technical standpoint, this is a terrific effort - crisp, sharp with everything detail well controlled and captured. From an artistic standpoint, it''s rather bland and uninviting to the viewer. Sometimes an image, even one as technically competant as this one is, is just an image. A worthy entry into the challenge and directly related to the challenge subject. A good effort falling short in the artistic sense.', '2009-04-19 19:14:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444083, 781137, 101256, '<td valign="top">A second image where the infrared/negative approach was used to create a SFx effect which in this case worked well. A technical and artistic success which does not require a lot of comment. A top ten image and potential ribbon winner.</td>', 'A second image where the infrared/negative approach was used to create a SFx effect which in this case worked well. A technical and artistic success which does not require a lot of comment. A top ten image and potential ribbon winner.', '2009-04-19 19:16:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444085, 781778, 101256, '<td valign="top">A very unique look at the challenge subject, this is nearly perfect in every way. Both a technical and artistic success, this static view from a unique perspective is unchallenged so far in being inventive. Crisp, sharp with well controlled bokeh, this should be a ribbon winner. Very well done.</td>', 'A very unique look at the challenge subject, this is nearly perfect in every way. Both a technical and artistic success, this static view from a unique perspective is unchallenged so far in being inventive. Crisp, sharp with well controlled bokeh, this should be a ribbon winner. Very well done.', '2009-04-19 19:18:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444086, 781678, 101256, '<td valign="top">From a technical standpoint, this is a terrific effort - crisp, sharp with everything detail well controlled and captured. From an artistic standpoint, it''s rather bland and uninviting to the viewer. Sometimes an image, even one as technically competant as this one is, is just an image. A worthy entry into the challenge and directly related to the challenge subject. A good effort falling short in the artistic sense.</td>', 'From a technical standpoint, this is a terrific effort - crisp, sharp with everything detail well controlled and captured. From an artistic standpoint, it''s rather bland and uninviting to the viewer. Sometimes an image, even one as technically competant as this one is, is just an image. A worthy entry into the challenge and directly related to the challenge subject. A good effort falling short in the artistic sense.', '2009-04-19 19:18:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444087, 781958, 101256, '<td valign="top">From a technical standpoint, this is a terrific effort - crisp, sharp with everything detail well controlled and captured. From an artistic standpoint, it''s rather bland and uninviting to the viewer. Sometimes an image, even one as technically competant as this one is, is just an image. A worthy entry into the challenge and directly related to the challenge subject. A good effort falling short in the artistic sense.</td>', 'From a technical standpoint, this is a terrific effort - crisp, sharp with everything detail well controlled and captured. From an artistic standpoint, it''s rather bland and uninviting to the viewer. Sometimes an image, even one as technically competant as this one is, is just an image. A worthy entry into the challenge and directly related to the challenge subject. A good effort falling short in the artistic sense.', '2009-04-19 19:18:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444091, 782420, 101256, '<td valign="top">An artistic success, the very slight oversharpening detracts from the images''s overall impact and effectiveness. It might have been better to leave the image alone in that respect and let it speak for itself. A unique angle and perspective. A good solid entry into the challenge.</td>', 'An artistic success, the very slight oversharpening detracts from the images''s overall impact and effectiveness. It might have been better to leave the image alone in that respect and let it speak for itself. A unique angle and perspective. A good solid entry into the challenge.', '2009-04-19 19:24:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444092, 781249, 101256, '<td valign="top">From a technical standpoint, this is a good effort - crisp, sharp with everything detail well controlled and captured. From an artistic standpoint, it''s rather bland and uninviting to the viewer. Sometimes an image, even one as technically competant as this one is, is just an image. A worthy entry into the challenge and directly related to the challenge subject. A good effort falling short in the artistic sense.</td>', 'From a technical standpoint, this is a good effort - crisp, sharp with everything detail well controlled and captured. From an artistic standpoint, it''s rather bland and uninviting to the viewer. Sometimes an image, even one as technically competant as this one is, is just an image. A worthy entry into the challenge and directly related to the challenge subject. A good effort falling short in the artistic sense.', '2009-04-19 19:25:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444093, 780757, 101256, '<td valign="top">From a technical standpoint, this is a terrific effort - crisp, sharp with everything detail well controlled and captured. From an artistic standpoint, it''s rather bland and uninviting to the viewer. Sometimes an image, even one as technically competant as this one is, is just an image. A worthy entry into the challenge and directly related to the challenge subject. A good effort falling short in the artistic sense.</td>', 'From a technical standpoint, this is a terrific effort - crisp, sharp with everything detail well controlled and captured. From an artistic standpoint, it''s rather bland and uninviting to the viewer. Sometimes an image, even one as technically competant as this one is, is just an image. A worthy entry into the challenge and directly related to the challenge subject. A good effort falling short in the artistic sense.', '2009-04-19 19:25:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444095, 782054, 101256, '<td valign="top">From a technical standpoint, this is a terrific effort - crisp, sharp with everything detail well controlled and captured. From an artistic standpoint, it''s rather bland and uninviting to the viewer because the over busy background detracts from the subject. Sometimes an image, even one technically competant. A worthy entry into the challenge and directly related to the challenge subject. A good effort falling short in the artistic sense.</td>', 'From a technical standpoint, this is a terrific effort - crisp, sharp with everything detail well controlled and captured. From an artistic standpoint, it''s rather bland and uninviting to the viewer because the over busy background detracts from the subject. Sometimes an image, even one technically competant. A worthy entry into the challenge and directly related to the challenge subject. A good effort falling short in the artistic sense.', '2009-04-19 19:26:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444096, 781869, 101256, '<td valign="top">The combination of curved and linear structures are a excellant choice and the overall "chromic" feel to this static shot is nearly perfect. The lighting highlights are just slightly over done making it not a perfect technical success. The details are clear and crisp. A worthy top twenty image.</td>', 'The combination of curved and linear structures are a excellant choice and the overall "chromic" feel to this static shot is nearly perfect. The lighting highlights are just slightly over done making it not a perfect technical success. The details are clear and crisp. A worthy top twenty image.', '2009-04-19 19:28:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444099, 782286, 101256, '<td valign="top">There is a time to comment and there is a time where a reviwer just has to shut up and vote. A complete technical and artistic success.</td>', 'There is a time to comment and there is a time where a reviwer just has to shut up and vote. A complete technical and artistic success.', '2009-04-19 19:29:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444100, 782434, 101256, '<td valign="top">There is a time to comment and a time to shut up and vote. Another perfect concept and perfectly executed image.</td>', 'There is a time to comment and a time to shut up and vote. Another perfect concept and perfectly executed image.', '2009-04-19 19:30:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444101, 782224, 101256, '<td valign="top">Clever, inventive and a clear sense of whimsy and humor. A complete artistic and technical success.</td>', 'Clever, inventive and a clear sense of whimsy and humor. A complete artistic and technical success.', '2009-04-19 19:30:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444103, 781536, 101256, '<td valign="top">From a technical standpoint, this is a good effort - not as crisp or sharp with everything detail well controlled and captured as it should be. From an artistic standpoint, it''s rather bland and uninviting to the viewer. Sometimes an image, even one as technically competant as this one is, is just an image. A worthy entry into the challenge and directly related to the challenge subject. A good effort falling short in the artistic sense.</td>', 'From a technical standpoint, this is a good effort - not as crisp or sharp with everything detail well controlled and captured as it should be. From an artistic standpoint, it''s rather bland and uninviting to the viewer. Sometimes an image, even one as technically competant as this one is, is just an image. A worthy entry into the challenge and directly related to the challenge subject. A good effort falling short in the artistic sense.', '2009-04-19 19:31:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444104, 781068, 101256, '<td valign="top">Very clever and inventive - a very real sense of dark humor. A technical success and from an artistic standpoint, the "jump" on the camera just adds to the images overall dark and tragic flippancy. Well done.</td>', 'Very clever and inventive - a very real sense of dark humor. A technical success and from an artistic standpoint, the "jump" on the camera just adds to the images overall dark and tragic flippancy. Well done.', '2009-04-19 19:36:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444106, 781735, 101256, '<td valign="top">From a technical standpoint, this is a terrific effort - crisp, sharp with everything detail well controlled and captured. From an artistic standpoint, it''s intriguing and very effective. A worthy entry into the challenge and directly related to the challenge subject. A good effort that should place well into the top ten.</td>', 'From a technical standpoint, this is a terrific effort - crisp, sharp with everything detail well controlled and captured. From an artistic standpoint, it''s intriguing and very effective. A worthy entry into the challenge and directly related to the challenge subject. A good effort that should place well into the top ten.', '2009-04-19 19:38:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444107, 780758, 101256, '<td valign="top">A little bit of a mixed metaphor makes this technical success a true winner. From an artistic standpoint, it conveys a different sense of whimsy and humor. A good sound entry into the challenge - a good combination of imagination and composition. Well done.</td>', 'A little bit of a mixed metaphor makes this technical success a true winner. From an artistic standpoint, it conveys a different sense of whimsy and humor. A good sound entry into the challenge - a good combination of imagination and composition. Well done.', '2009-04-19 19:40:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444108, 782340, 101256, '<td valign="top">Another highly inventive look at the challenge subject, this image is a technical success, but the bee lacks some definition and detail - although that is the point when something this small is run over by a train. A good well thought out image and a worthy entry into the challnege from both an technical and artistic standpoint.</td>', 'Another highly inventive look at the challenge subject, this image is a technical success, but the bee lacks some definition and detail - although that is the point when something this small is run over by a train. A good well thought out image and a worthy entry into the challnege from both an technical and artistic standpoint.', '2009-04-19 19:42:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444110, 782343, 101256, '<td valign="top">It''s often better when viewing an image that makes one laugh is to come back and look at it again. After doing so, this is definetly a ten if only because of it''s clever use of toys that meet the challenge subject. While technically flawed, it is a complete artistic success.</td>', 'It''s often better when viewing an image that makes one laugh is to come back and look at it again. After doing so, this is definetly a ten if only because of it''s clever use of toys that meet the challenge subject. While technically flawed, it is a complete artistic success.', '2009-04-19 19:44:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444111, 781850, 101256, '<td valign="top">Richly detailed, the major flaw of the rather blank and univiting windows (a result of difficult lighting conditions) are unfortunate. From an artistic standpoint, this is richly detailed and very effective - with the sole exception of the windows. The author might want to revisit this image at some point and work with post processing software to reduce the overall blankness and/or layer some detail into the image. A good entry into the challenge.</td>', 'Richly detailed, the major flaw of the rather blank and univiting windows (a result of difficult lighting conditions) are unfortunate. From an artistic standpoint, this is richly detailed and very effective - with the sole exception of the windows. The author might want to revisit this image at some point and work with post processing software to reduce the overall blankness and/or layer some detail into the image. A good entry into the challenge.', '2009-04-19 19:46:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444113, 782425, 101256, '<td valign="top">From a technical standpoint, this is less effective that it could be. From an artistic standpoint, it''s rather bland and uninviting to the viewer. Sometimes an image is just an image. A good effort falling short in the artistic and technical sense. A little more thought with respect to lighting conditions and how it affects the subject matter would have helped.</td>', 'From a technical standpoint, this is less effective that it could be. From an artistic standpoint, it''s rather bland and uninviting to the viewer. Sometimes an image is just an image. A good effort falling short in the artistic and technical sense. A little more thought with respect to lighting conditions and how it affects the subject matter would have helped.', '2009-04-19 19:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444114, 782024, 101256, '<td valign="top">From a technical standpoint, this is a terrific effort - crisp, sharp with everything detail well controlled and captured. From an artistic standpoint, it''s rather bland and uninviting to the viewer. Sometimes an image, even one as technically competant as this one is, is just an image. A worthy entry into the challenge and directly related to the challenge subject. A good effort falling short in the artistic sense.</td>', 'From a technical standpoint, this is a terrific effort - crisp, sharp with everything detail well controlled and captured. From an artistic standpoint, it''s rather bland and uninviting to the viewer. Sometimes an image, even one as technically competant as this one is, is just an image. A worthy entry into the challenge and directly related to the challenge subject. A good effort falling short in the artistic sense.', '2009-04-19 19:48:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444115, 782247, 101256, '<td valign="top">From a technical standpoint, this is a terrific effort - crisp, sharp with everything detail well controlled and captured. From an artistic standpoint, it''s rather bland and uninviting to the viewer. Sometimes an image, even one as technically competant as this one is, is just an image. A worthy entry into the challenge and directly related to the challenge subject. A good effort falling short in the artistic sense.</td>', 'From a technical standpoint, this is a terrific effort - crisp, sharp with everything detail well controlled and captured. From an artistic standpoint, it''s rather bland and uninviting to the viewer. Sometimes an image, even one as technically competant as this one is, is just an image. A worthy entry into the challenge and directly related to the challenge subject. A good effort falling short in the artistic sense.', '2009-04-19 19:48:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444127, 781964, 101256, '<td valign="top">The only complaint I have is that the engine is a little less detailed than it could have been, but the overall ethereal effect is excellant and the image has terrific impact. A complete artistic success and a nitpicky technical success. Well done.</td>', 'The only complaint I have is that the engine is a little less detailed than it could have been, but the overall ethereal effect is excellant and the image has terrific impact. A complete artistic success and a nitpicky technical success. Well done.', '2009-04-19 20:15:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444128, 782057, 101256, '<td valign="top">From a technical standpoint, this is a terrific effort - crisp, sharp with everything detail well controlled and captured. From an artistic standpoint, it''s rather bland and uninviting to the viewer. Sometimes an image, even one as technically competant as this one is, is just an image. A worthy entry into the challenge and directly related to the challenge subject. A good effort falling short in the artistic sense.</td>', 'From a technical standpoint, this is a terrific effort - crisp, sharp with everything detail well controlled and captured. From an artistic standpoint, it''s rather bland and uninviting to the viewer. Sometimes an image, even one as technically competant as this one is, is just an image. A worthy entry into the challenge and directly related to the challenge subject. A good effort falling short in the artistic sense.', '2009-04-19 20:15:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444130, 781860, 101256, '<td valign="top">The monotone feel and treatment is stellar - a perfect image from a technical and artistic sense. It would be a nit pick to complain about the overaly blank sky, but the nature of the composition is such that the subject is so perfectly framed and the image composed that one doesn''t notice until well after the image has had it''s impact. Well done and a certain ribbon contender.</td>', 'The monotone feel and treatment is stellar - a perfect image from a technical and artistic sense. It would be a nit pick to complain about the overaly blank sky, but the nature of the composition is such that the subject is so perfectly framed and the image composed that one doesn''t notice until well after the image has had it''s impact. Well done and a certain ribbon contender.', '2009-04-19 20:17:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444132, 782184, 101256, '<td valign="top">From a technical standpoint, this is a terrific effort - crisp, sharp with everything detail well controlled and captured. From an artistic standpoint, it''s rather bland and uninviting to the viewer - images occasionally suffer from too much detail and this is one. Sometimes an image, even one as technically competant as this one is, is just an image. A worthy entry into the challenge and directly related to the challenge subject. A good effort falling short in the artistic sense.</td>', 'From a technical standpoint, this is a terrific effort - crisp, sharp with everything detail well controlled and captured. From an artistic standpoint, it''s rather bland and uninviting to the viewer - images occasionally suffer from too much detail and this is one. Sometimes an image, even one as technically competant as this one is, is just an image. A worthy entry into the challenge and directly related to the challenge subject. A good effort falling short in the artistic sense.', '2009-04-19 20:18:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444134, 782170, 101256, '<td valign="top">A combination of pastoral scene and challenge subject this is beautiful and artistic perfection. Green is the most difficult color to properly control digitally and the author has not only accomplished that in spectacular fashion, but used it to properly balance the tones of the rail car. Not a single issue to nit pick - even the reflection in the car''s windows is perfectly focused and presented. A perfect example of a well though out image congnizant of the challenge subject and artistic impression. A ribbon winner for sure. Well done.</td>', 'A combination of pastoral scene and challenge subject this is beautiful and artistic perfection. Green is the most difficult color to properly control digitally and the author has not only accomplished that in spectacular fashion, but used it to properly balance the tones of the rail car. Not a single issue to nit pick - even the reflection in the car''s windows is perfectly focused and presented. A perfect example of a well though out image congnizant of the challenge subject and artistic impression. A ribbon winner for sure. Well done.', '2009-04-19 20:22:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444135, 781201, 101256, '<td valign="top">From a technical standpoint, this is a terrific effort - crisp, sharp with everything detail well controlled and captured. From an artistic standpoint, it''s rather bland and uninviting to the viewer. Sometimes an image, even one as technically competant as this one is, is just an image. A worthy entry into the challenge and directly related to the challenge subject. A good effort falling short in the artistic sense.</td>', 'From a technical standpoint, this is a terrific effort - crisp, sharp with everything detail well controlled and captured. From an artistic standpoint, it''s rather bland and uninviting to the viewer. Sometimes an image, even one as technically competant as this one is, is just an image. A worthy entry into the challenge and directly related to the challenge subject. A good effort falling short in the artistic sense.', '2009-04-19 20:22:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444136, 781676, 101256, '<td valign="top">Occasionally, a photographer has a great idea and just takes it ever so slightly over the edge which flaws an otherwise good effort. This is a good example of that - the shot angle is way too sharp to be effective in an artistic sense - less of an angle would have been very helpful and taken it from an also ran into ribbon contention. From a technical standpoint, this is perfect and a complete success - crisp and sharp with excellant DOF control.</td>', 'Occasionally, a photographer has a great idea and just takes it ever so slightly over the edge which flaws an otherwise good effort. This is a good example of that - the shot angle is way too sharp to be effective in an artistic sense - less of an angle would have been very helpful and taken it from an also ran into ribbon contention. From a technical standpoint, this is perfect and a complete success - crisp and sharp with excellant DOF control.', '2009-04-19 20:24:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444139, 782351, 101256, '<td valign="top">Overdone effects ruin an otherwise good idea. A better approach would have been to reduce the SFx concept and just create an image. There is a good idea here - it''s just inartfully executed and frankly fails to impress in either a technical or artistic sense. More thought into how this image presents would have been a plus.</td>', 'Overdone effects ruin an otherwise good idea. A better approach would have been to reduce the SFx concept and just create an image. There is a good idea here - it''s just inartfully executed and frankly fails to impress in either a technical or artistic sense. More thought into how this image presents would have been a plus.', '2009-04-19 20:27:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444142, 782314, 101256, '<td valign="top">From a technical standpoint, this is unfortunately ruined by oversharpening which is a major flaw. From an artistic standpoint, if the temptation to oversharpen had been avoided, it would have been more than acceptable. If the image hadn''t been oversharpened, this would have had significant impact on the viewer and should have placed well as the slight color cast is a major plus. Very unfortunate and the author would do well to critically examine the submissions for flaws like this before submitting.</td>', 'From a technical standpoint, this is unfortunately ruined by oversharpening which is a major flaw. From an artistic standpoint, if the temptation to oversharpen had been avoided, it would have been more than acceptable. If the image hadn''t been oversharpened, this would have had significant impact on the viewer and should have placed well as the slight color cast is a major plus. Very unfortunate and the author would do well to critically examine the submissions for flaws like this before submitting.', '2009-04-19 20:30:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444143, 781959, 101256, '<td valign="top">From a technical standpoint, this is a terrific effort - crisp, sharp with everything detail well controlled and captured. From an artistic standpoint, it''s rather bland and uninviting to the viewer because it''s overly busy affecting and detracting from the subject matter. Sometimes an image, even one as technically competant as this one is, is just an image. A worthy entry into the challenge and directly related to the challenge subject. A good effort falling short in the artistic sense.</td>', 'From a technical standpoint, this is a terrific effort - crisp, sharp with everything detail well controlled and captured. From an artistic standpoint, it''s rather bland and uninviting to the viewer because it''s overly busy affecting and detracting from the subject matter. Sometimes an image, even one as technically competant as this one is, is just an image. A worthy entry into the challenge and directly related to the challenge subject. A good effort falling short in the artistic sense.', '2009-04-19 20:31:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444144, 782338, 101256, '<td valign="top">From a technical standpoint, this is a terrific effort - crisp, sharp with everything detail well controlled and captured. From an artistic standpoint, it''s rather bland and uninviting to the viewer. Sometimes an image, even one as technically competant as this one is, is just an image. A worthy entry into the challenge and directly related to the challenge subject. A good effort falling short in the artistic sense.</td>', 'From a technical standpoint, this is a terrific effort - crisp, sharp with everything detail well controlled and captured. From an artistic standpoint, it''s rather bland and uninviting to the viewer. Sometimes an image, even one as technically competant as this one is, is just an image. A worthy entry into the challenge and directly related to the challenge subject. A good effort falling short in the artistic sense.', '2009-04-19 20:31:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444145, 782431, 101256, '<td valign="top">From a technical standpoint, this is a good effort - the slight grain is a positive. From an artistic standpoint, it''s rather bland and uninviting to the viewer with nothing in particular to recommend it. The sky should be interesting and have some impact, but doesn''t. Sometimes an image, even one as technically competant as this one is, is just an image. A worthy entry into the challenge and directly related to the challenge subject. A good effort falling short in the artistic sense.</td>', 'From a technical standpoint, this is a good effort - the slight grain is a positive. From an artistic standpoint, it''s rather bland and uninviting to the viewer with nothing in particular to recommend it. The sky should be interesting and have some impact, but doesn''t. Sometimes an image, even one as technically competant as this one is, is just an image. A worthy entry into the challenge and directly related to the challenge subject. A good effort falling short in the artistic sense.', '2009-04-19 20:32:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444146, 782404, 101256, '<td valign="top">From a technical standpoint, this is a terrific effort - crisp, sharp with everything detail well controlled and captured. From an artistic standpoint, it''s rather bland and uninviting to the viewer. Sometimes an image, even one as technically competant as this one is, is just an image. A worthy entry into the challenge and directly related to the challenge subject. A good effort falling short in the artistic sense.</td>', 'From a technical standpoint, this is a terrific effort - crisp, sharp with everything detail well controlled and captured. From an artistic standpoint, it''s rather bland and uninviting to the viewer. Sometimes an image, even one as technically competant as this one is, is just an image. A worthy entry into the challenge and directly related to the challenge subject. A good effort falling short in the artistic sense.', '2009-04-19 20:32:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444147, 782371, 101256, '<td valign="top">From a technical standpoint, this is a terrific effort - crisp, sharp with everything detail well controlled and captured. From an artistic standpoint, it''s rather bland and uninviting to the viewer. Sometimes an image, even one as technically competant as this one is, is just an image. A worthy entry into the challenge and directly related to the challenge subject. A good effort falling short in the artistic sense.</td>', 'From a technical standpoint, this is a terrific effort - crisp, sharp with everything detail well controlled and captured. From an artistic standpoint, it''s rather bland and uninviting to the viewer. Sometimes an image, even one as technically competant as this one is, is just an image. A worthy entry into the challenge and directly related to the challenge subject. A good effort falling short in the artistic sense.', '2009-04-19 20:32:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444148, 782232, 101256, '<td valign="top">From a technical standpoint this is good, but flawed. The over dark subject matter as compared to the title doesn''t quite work. This flaw affects the image from an artistic standpoint, it''s rather bland and uninviting to the viewer. Sometimes an image is just an image and author''s need to recognise that. Having said that a worthy entry into the challenge and directly related to the challenge subject. A good effort falling short in being a success in the technical and artistic sense.</td>', 'From a technical standpoint this is good, but flawed. The over dark subject matter as compared to the title doesn''t quite work. This flaw affects the image from an artistic standpoint, it''s rather bland and uninviting to the viewer. Sometimes an image is just an image and author''s need to recognise that. Having said that a worthy entry into the challenge and directly related to the challenge subject. A good effort falling short in being a success in the technical and artistic sense.', '2009-04-19 20:37:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444151, 781579, 101256, '<td valign="top">From an artistic standpoint, it''s rather bland and uninviting to the viewer. This might have been a good image to experiment with using sepia or other monotone technique to "antique" it and increase the visual impact and match the sometimes imprecise lens and glass plate effect. In this case, the less than precise focus hurts it''s visual impact and from a technical standpoint, the lighting could have been better controlled. A good effort falling short in the artistic and technical sense. A little more thought in presentation would have been in order. The author should be encouraged to experiment with the image as mentioned above and enter this image into a print contest - it would probably be a winner.</td>', 'From an artistic standpoint, it''s rather bland and uninviting to the viewer. This might have been a good image to experiment with using sepia or other monotone technique to "antique" it and increase the visual impact and match the sometimes imprecise lens and glass plate effect. In this case, the less than precise focus hurts it''s visual impact and from a technical standpoint, the lighting could have been better controlled. A good effort falling short in the artistic and technical sense. A little more thought in presentation would have been in order. The author should be encouraged to experiment with the image as mentioned above and enter this image into a print contest - it would probably be a winner.', '2009-04-19 20:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444152, 781680, 101256, '<td valign="top">From a technical standpoint, this is a terrific effort - crisp, sharp with everything detail well controlled and captured. From an artistic standpoint, it''s rather bland and uninviting to the viewer. Sometimes an image, even one as technically competant as this one is, is just an image. A worthy entry into the challenge and directly related to the challenge subject. A good effort falling short in the artistic sense.</td>', 'From a technical standpoint, this is a terrific effort - crisp, sharp with everything detail well controlled and captured. From an artistic standpoint, it''s rather bland and uninviting to the viewer. Sometimes an image, even one as technically competant as this one is, is just an image. A worthy entry into the challenge and directly related to the challenge subject. A good effort falling short in the artistic sense.', '2009-04-19 20:41:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444153, 781956, 101256, '<td valign="top">From a technical standpoint, this is a terrific effort - crisp, sharp with everything detail well controlled and captured. From an artistic standpoint, it''s rather bland and uninviting to the viewer. Sometimes an image, even one as technically competant as this one is, is just an image. A worthy entry into the challenge and directly related to the challenge subject. A good effort falling short in the artistic sense.</td>', 'From a technical standpoint, this is a terrific effort - crisp, sharp with everything detail well controlled and captured. From an artistic standpoint, it''s rather bland and uninviting to the viewer. Sometimes an image, even one as technically competant as this one is, is just an image. A worthy entry into the challenge and directly related to the challenge subject. A good effort falling short in the artistic sense.', '2009-04-19 20:41:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444155, 782265, 101256, '<td valign="top">From a technical standpoint, this is a terrific effort - crisp, sharp with everything detail well controlled and captured. From an artistic standpoint, it''s rather bland and uninviting to the viewer which is a by-product of the monotone treatment. A black and white might have been a better choice with more contrast to invite the viewer to look at the details. Sometimes an image, even one as technically competant as this one is, is just an image and that may be due to the rather bland monotone. A worthy entry into the challenge and directly related to the challenge subject. A good effort falling short in the artistic sense.</td>', 'From a technical standpoint, this is a terrific effort - crisp, sharp with everything detail well controlled and captured. From an artistic standpoint, it''s rather bland and uninviting to the viewer which is a by-product of the monotone treatment. A black and white might have been a better choice with more contrast to invite the viewer to look at the details. Sometimes an image, even one as technically competant as this one is, is just an image and that may be due to the rather bland monotone. A worthy entry into the challenge and directly related to the challenge subject. A good effort falling short in the artistic sense.', '2009-04-19 20:42:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444159, 781383, 101256, '<td valign="top">From a technical standpoint, this is an average effort being overly dark. From an artistic standpoint, it''s rather bland and uninviting to the viewer. Sometimes an image is just an image - a little more thought into composing this and using good lighting techniques such as a long flash or maybe even bouncing a flash to help the mood would have been a better choice. A longer exposure time might have been a plus. A good effort falling short in the artistic sense.</td>', 'From a technical standpoint, this is an average effort being overly dark. From an artistic standpoint, it''s rather bland and uninviting to the viewer. Sometimes an image is just an image - a little more thought into composing this and using good lighting techniques such as a long flash or maybe even bouncing a flash to help the mood would have been a better choice. A longer exposure time might have been a plus. A good effort falling short in the artistic sense.', '2009-04-19 20:45:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444160, 782359, 101256, '<td valign="top">From a technical standpoint, this is a terrific effort - crisp, sharp with everything detail well controlled and captured. From an artistic standpoint, it''s rather bland and uninviting to the viewer. Sometimes an image, even one as technically competant as this one is, is just an image. A worthy entry into the challenge and directly related to the challenge subject. A good effort falling short in the artistic sense.</td>', 'From a technical standpoint, this is a terrific effort - crisp, sharp with everything detail well controlled and captured. From an artistic standpoint, it''s rather bland and uninviting to the viewer. Sometimes an image, even one as technically competant as this one is, is just an image. A worthy entry into the challenge and directly related to the challenge subject. A good effort falling short in the artistic sense.', '2009-04-19 20:45:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444161, 781641, 101256, '<td valign="top">From a technical standpoint, this is a terrific effort - crisp, sharp with everything detail well controlled and captured. From an artistic standpoint, it''s rather bland and uninviting to the viewer. Sometimes an image, even one as technically competant as this one is, is just an image. A worthy entry into the challenge and directly related to the challenge subject. A good effort falling short in the artistic sense.</td>', 'From a technical standpoint, this is a terrific effort - crisp, sharp with everything detail well controlled and captured. From an artistic standpoint, it''s rather bland and uninviting to the viewer. Sometimes an image, even one as technically competant as this one is, is just an image. A worthy entry into the challenge and directly related to the challenge subject. A good effort falling short in the artistic sense.', '2009-04-19 20:45:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444162, 781867, 101256, '<td valign="top">This image is a clear favorite to take a ribbon. Strong, purposeful with no major flaws to speak of and the minor issues are not relevant to the image''s overall impact. Crisp and sharp, the author made a concerted effort to compose and capture a mood that works very well - even the action of the cloth is perfect and the model''s action and expression are perfect. An image with a lot of visual impact and detail. This would do well in any competition themed or not. A personal favorite of this reviewer. If there were any justice in the world, this would be a blue ribbon. Well done.</td>', 'This image is a clear favorite to take a ribbon. Strong, purposeful with no major flaws to speak of and the minor issues are not relevant to the image''s overall impact. Crisp and sharp, the author made a concerted effort to compose and capture a mood that works very well - even the action of the cloth is perfect and the model''s action and expression are perfect. An image with a lot of visual impact and detail. This would do well in any competition themed or not. A personal favorite of this reviewer. If there were any justice in the world, this would be a blue ribbon. Well done.', '2009-04-19 20:45:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444163, 781542, 101256, '<td valign="top">A very unique entry into the challenge with a very different viewpoint. The subtle angle adds a lot to the drama of the image and is a technical and artistic success. This image works on several levels and the dramatic sky just enhances the overall effect. Well thought out and composed, it should be an example of "how to". One minor flaw that might be generally missed is that the image is just a touch over sharpened, but it''s not immediately noticable and really requires a close and over critical look. This should be a top ten and almost certainly a ribbon winner. Well done.</td>', 'A very unique entry into the challenge with a very different viewpoint. The subtle angle adds a lot to the drama of the image and is a technical and artistic success. This image works on several levels and the dramatic sky just enhances the overall effect. Well thought out and composed, it should be an example of "how to". One minor flaw that might be generally missed is that the image is just a touch over sharpened, but it''s not immediately noticable and really requires a close and over critical look. This should be a top ten and almost certainly a ribbon winner. Well done.', '2009-04-19 20:45:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444169, 781962, 101256, '<td valign="top">A technical and artistic success, this image falls just short of being perfect - a crisper image would have been a plus as the slight soft focus, while completely acceptable, does not invite closer inspection. The monotone treatment, while acceptable, could be a little denser. Overall, a great composition and very pleasing from an esthetic sense.</td>', 'A technical and artistic success, this image falls just short of being perfect - a crisper image would have been a plus as the slight soft focus, while completely acceptable, does not invite closer inspection. The monotone treatment, while acceptable, could be a little denser. Overall, a great composition and very pleasing from an esthetic sense.', '2009-04-19 20:49:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444170, 782418, 101256, '<td valign="top">From a technical standpoint, this is a terrific effort - crisp, sharp with everything detail well controlled and captured. From an artistic standpoint, it''s rather bland and uninviting to the viewer. Sometimes an image, even one as technically competant as this one is, is just an image. A worthy entry into the challenge and directly related to the challenge subject. A good effort falling short in the artistic sense.</td>', 'From a technical standpoint, this is a terrific effort - crisp, sharp with everything detail well controlled and captured. From an artistic standpoint, it''s rather bland and uninviting to the viewer. Sometimes an image, even one as technically competant as this one is, is just an image. A worthy entry into the challenge and directly related to the challenge subject. A good effort falling short in the artistic sense.', '2009-04-19 20:49:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444180, 782051, 101256, '<td valign="top">Simple, beautiful and elegant. The slightly overdone rail highlights are a minor flaw not noticable until the viewer really looks closely. Very effective use of monotone to create a sense of times past. Very well done and should be a top ten entry.</td>', 'Simple, beautiful and elegant. The slightly overdone rail highlights are a minor flaw not noticable until the viewer really looks closely. Very effective use of monotone to create a sense of times past. Very well done and should be a top ten entry.', '2009-04-19 20:52:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444183, 782348, 101256, '<td valign="top">The temptation to over do the SFx with the negative/infrared conversion was totally avoided making for a very effective and impressive image. Stunning from a visual standpoint, it is both an artistic and technical successs - a very good use of post-processing tools and not over done in any sense of the word. Well done - a top ten contender.</td>', 'The temptation to over do the SFx with the negative/infrared conversion was totally avoided making for a very effective and impressive image. Stunning from a visual standpoint, it is both an artistic and technical successs - a very good use of post-processing tools and not over done in any sense of the word. Well done - a top ten contender.', '2009-04-19 20:54:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444184, 781453, 101256, '<td valign="top">From a technical standpoint, this is a terrific effort - crisp, sharp with everything detail well controlled and captured. From an artistic standpoint, it''s rather bland and uninviting to the viewer. Sometimes an image, even one as technically competant as this one is, is just an image. A worthy entry into the challenge and directly related to the challenge subject. A good effort falling short in the artistic sense.</td>', 'From a technical standpoint, this is a terrific effort - crisp, sharp with everything detail well controlled and captured. From an artistic standpoint, it''s rather bland and uninviting to the viewer. Sometimes an image, even one as technically competant as this one is, is just an image. A worthy entry into the challenge and directly related to the challenge subject. A good effort falling short in the artistic sense.', '2009-04-19 20:54:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444185, 781199, 101256, '<td valign="top">Very effective use of lighting to create a halo effect around the engine which is simply so unusual that it is remarkable. The author had a good eye for composition and used it to good effect. Sometimes it''s better not to say anything and just compliment the author on a solid effort and a complete technical and artistic success. Well done.</td>', 'Very effective use of lighting to create a halo effect around the engine which is simply so unusual that it is remarkable. The author had a good eye for composition and used it to good effect. Sometimes it''s better not to say anything and just compliment the author on a solid effort and a complete technical and artistic success. Well done.', '2009-04-19 20:56:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444188, 781723, 101256, '<td valign="top">An effective and well thought out image - lighting is well controlled, color and saturation are very effective and the overall impression is positive. However, it''s not particularly unique and the unfortunate cut off of the engine on the right side of the image is a irritant and flaws an otherwise excellant entry.</td>', 'An effective and well thought out image - lighting is well controlled, color and saturation are very effective and the overall impression is positive. However, it''s not particularly unique and the unfortunate cut off of the engine on the right side of the image is a irritant and flaws an otherwise excellant entry.', '2009-04-19 20:59:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444189, 781308, 101256, '<td valign="top">From a technical standpoint, this is a terrific effort - crisp, sharp with everything detail well controlled and captured. From an artistic standpoint, it''s rather bland and uninviting to the viewer. Sometimes an image, even one as technically competant as this one is, is just an image. A worthy entry into the challenge and directly related to the challenge subject. A good effort falling short in the artistic sense.</td>', 'From a technical standpoint, this is a terrific effort - crisp, sharp with everything detail well controlled and captured. From an artistic standpoint, it''s rather bland and uninviting to the viewer. Sometimes an image, even one as technically competant as this one is, is just an image. A worthy entry into the challenge and directly related to the challenge subject. A good effort falling short in the artistic sense.', '2009-04-19 20:59:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444200, 782089, 101256, '<td valign="top">From a technical standpoint, this is a terrific effort - crisp, sharp with everything detail well controlled and captured. From an artistic standpoint it appears to be slightly over saturated, but isn''t. A worthy entry into the challenge and directly related to the challenge subject. A good effort and if the saturation was turned down just a little, it would have been near perfect. The author might want to experiment with this image a little by giving it a black and white conversion and playing with curves or tone mapping to give it a different look for entry into print competitions.</td>', 'From a technical standpoint, this is a terrific effort - crisp, sharp with everything detail well controlled and captured. From an artistic standpoint it appears to be slightly over saturated, but isn''t. A worthy entry into the challenge and directly related to the challenge subject. A good effort and if the saturation was turned down just a little, it would have been near perfect. The author might want to experiment with this image a little by giving it a black and white conversion and playing with curves or tone mapping to give it a different look for entry into print competitions.', '2009-04-19 21:08:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444203, 781974, 101256, '<td valign="top">There are times to comment and times to vote. This is one of them. Well done.</td>', 'There are times to comment and times to vote. This is one of them. Well done.', '2009-04-19 21:08:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444205, 782203, 101256, '<td valign="top">From a technical standpoint, this is a terrific effort - crisp, sharp with everything detail well controlled and captured. From an artistic standpoint, it''s also very effective. Personal choice would have been to have less steam obscuring the front of the engine, but it works just fine as it is. A worthy entry into the challenge and directly related to the challenge subject. A good effort being a technical and artistic success.</td>', 'From a technical standpoint, this is a terrific effort - crisp, sharp with everything detail well controlled and captured. From an artistic standpoint, it''s also very effective. Personal choice would have been to have less steam obscuring the front of the engine, but it works just fine as it is. A worthy entry into the challenge and directly related to the challenge subject. A good effort being a technical and artistic success.', '2009-04-19 21:10:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444206, 782201, 101256, '<td valign="top">Effective, technically perfect and very appealing in an artistic sense. Well tought out with a few minor issues not even worth mentioning. Should be a ribbon contender - nothing more to say - a ten and worth every single point.</td>', 'Effective, technically perfect and very appealing in an artistic sense. Well tought out with a few minor issues not even worth mentioning. Should be a ribbon contender - nothing more to say - a ten and worth every single point.', '2009-04-19 21:11:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444210, 782334, 101256, '<td valign="top">Similar to an earlier entry (one might suspect that this is the same image only taken at night), this is a very effective image. The highlights are just on the edge of being overdone, the lighting is subtle and effective and the color reflections are simple and elegant. The compare and contrast between the modern and post-modern is extremely effective and the way this is presented, much more visualy appealing than the earlier image. A top ten contender and a possible ribbon winner.</td>', 'Similar to an earlier entry (one might suspect that this is the same image only taken at night), this is a very effective image. The highlights are just on the edge of being overdone, the lighting is subtle and effective and the color reflections are simple and elegant. The compare and contrast between the modern and post-modern is extremely effective and the way this is presented, much more visualy appealing than the earlier image. A top ten contender and a possible ribbon winner.', '2009-04-19 21:14:21.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(5444212, 781506, 101256, '<td valign="top">From a technical standpoint, this is a terrific effort - crisp, sharp with everything detail well controlled and captured. From an artistic standpoint, it''s rather bland and uninviting to the viewer. Sometimes an image, even one as technically competant as this one is, is just an image. A worthy entry into the challenge and directly related to the challenge subject. A good effort falling short in the artistic sense.</td>', 'From a technical standpoint, this is a terrific effort - crisp, sharp with everything detail well controlled and captured. From an artistic standpoint, it''s rather bland and uninviting to the viewer. Sometimes an image, even one as technically competant as this one is, is just an image. A worthy entry into the challenge and directly related to the challenge subject. A good effort falling short in the artistic sense.', '2009-04-19 21:16:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444217, 782205, 101256, '<td valign="top">Long linear shots like this are difficult to capture properly and the author has done well to handle both the concept and lighting properly and very effectively. The highlights are right on the edge, but the conversion to black and white more than make up for it. A great demonstration of how space is properly handled giving a sense of dimension and unusually time. Very well done - a potential top ten image and ribbon winner.</td>', 'Long linear shots like this are difficult to capture properly and the author has done well to handle both the concept and lighting properly and very effectively. The highlights are right on the edge, but the conversion to black and white more than make up for it. A great demonstration of how space is properly handled giving a sense of dimension and unusually time. Very well done - a potential top ten image and ribbon winner.', '2009-04-19 21:18:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444218, 781810, 101256, '<td valign="top">From a technical standpoint, this is a terrific effort - crisp, sharp with everything detail well controlled and captured. From an artistic standpoint, it''s rather bland and uninviting to the viewer because it''s a very common angle to take a machinery image from. Sometimes an image, even one as technically competant as this one is, is just an image. A worthy entry into the challenge and directly related to the challenge subject. A good effort falling short in the artistic sense.</td>', 'From a technical standpoint, this is a terrific effort - crisp, sharp with everything detail well controlled and captured. From an artistic standpoint, it''s rather bland and uninviting to the viewer because it''s a very common angle to take a machinery image from. Sometimes an image, even one as technically competant as this one is, is just an image. A worthy entry into the challenge and directly related to the challenge subject. A good effort falling short in the artistic sense.', '2009-04-19 21:19:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444221, 781120, 101256, '<td valign="top">From a technical standpoint, this is a terrific effort - crisp, sharp with everything detail well controlled and captured. From an artistic standpoint, it''s rather bland and uninviting to the viewer. It might have been better to approach this from a higher view along the train or even a slightly different angle along the horizontal axis. It''s unfortunate that a technically perfect image is flawed by a common, average approach. A good effort falling short in the artistic sense.</td>', 'From a technical standpoint, this is a terrific effort - crisp, sharp with everything detail well controlled and captured. From an artistic standpoint, it''s rather bland and uninviting to the viewer. It might have been better to approach this from a higher view along the train or even a slightly different angle along the horizontal axis. It''s unfortunate that a technically perfect image is flawed by a common, average approach. A good effort falling short in the artistic sense.', '2009-04-19 21:21:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444223, 782161, 101256, '<td valign="top">The rather odd choice of color cast is only a plus to this wonderfully detailed and composed image. There are no major flaws making it both a completel technical and artistic success. The author should be proud of this image in every way. Well done.</td>', 'The rather odd choice of color cast is only a plus to this wonderfully detailed and composed image. There are no major flaws making it both a completel technical and artistic success. The author should be proud of this image in every way. Well done.', '2009-04-19 21:22:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444224, 782202, 101256, '<td valign="top">A good effort, this imae is just slightly out of focus which distorts the extreme details that are viewable. The lighting choice is unfortunate because of the occasional halos cast along the more linear shapes. Just short of being a technical and artistic success, a little more time in composing the image would have been a plus. At it is, a good entry into the challenge.</td>', 'A good effort, this imae is just slightly out of focus which distorts the extreme details that are viewable. The lighting choice is unfortunate because of the occasional halos cast along the more linear shapes. Just short of being a technical and artistic success, a little more time in composing the image would have been a plus. At it is, a good entry into the challenge.', '2009-04-19 21:24:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444225, 781116, 101256, '<td valign="top">From a technical standpoint, this is a terrific effort - crisp, sharp with everything detail well controlled and captured. From an artistic standpoint, it''s rather bland and uninviting to the viewer. Sometimes an image, even one as technically competant as this one is, is just an image. A worthy entry into the challenge and directly related to the challenge subject. A good effort falling short in the artistic sense.</td>', 'From a technical standpoint, this is a terrific effort - crisp, sharp with everything detail well controlled and captured. From an artistic standpoint, it''s rather bland and uninviting to the viewer. Sometimes an image, even one as technically competant as this one is, is just an image. A worthy entry into the challenge and directly related to the challenge subject. A good effort falling short in the artistic sense.', '2009-04-19 21:24:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444229, 781200, 101256, '<td valign="top">The combination of linear and curved shapes make this a very intriguing and effective image. Good solid lighting control and the author avoided the temptation to over expose to capture more than necessary. A success from a technical and artistic standpoint, the author might be well served to experiment with black and white, grayscale and/or antiquing treatment for print competitions - this would work well in any of the genres. Well done.</td>', 'The combination of linear and curved shapes make this a very intriguing and effective image. Good solid lighting control and the author avoided the temptation to over expose to capture more than necessary. A success from a technical and artistic standpoint, the author might be well served to experiment with black and white, grayscale and/or antiquing treatment for print competitions - this would work well in any of the genres. Well done.', '2009-04-19 21:27:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444235, 782228, 101256, '<td valign="top">From a technical standpoint, this is a terrific effort - crisp, sharp with everything detail well controlled and captured. From an artistic standpoint, it appears at first to be overly dark, but on a third viewing, it would appear that the author captured the essence of abandoned warehouses. It is very similar to cut scenes in action movies. The author might want to experiment with this image a little in the future by adjusting curves or even experimenting with different monotone techniques or tone mapping.</td>', 'From a technical standpoint, this is a terrific effort - crisp, sharp with everything detail well controlled and captured. From an artistic standpoint, it appears at first to be overly dark, but on a third viewing, it would appear that the author captured the essence of abandoned warehouses. It is very similar to cut scenes in action movies. The author might want to experiment with this image a little in the future by adjusting curves or even experimenting with different monotone techniques or tone mapping.', '2009-04-19 21:30:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444237, 782226, 101256, '<td valign="top">From a technical standpoint, this is a terrific effort - crisp, sharp with everything detail well controlled and captured. From an artistic standpoint, it''s rather bland and uninviting to the viewer. Sometimes an image, even one as technically competant as this one is, is just an image. A good effort falling short in the artistic sense.</td>', 'From a technical standpoint, this is a terrific effort - crisp, sharp with everything detail well controlled and captured. From an artistic standpoint, it''s rather bland and uninviting to the viewer. Sometimes an image, even one as technically competant as this one is, is just an image. A good effort falling short in the artistic sense.', '2009-04-19 21:30:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444239, 781888, 101256, '<td valign="top">Much too busy to be effective, the motion is completely overdone and has literally no impact on the viewer. The author''s intent was clear, but the whole process of capturing this type of image needed more thought. Not a success from a technical or artistic standpoint. A more head on approach to this type of image would have been better and much more effective - a need for more definite shape in the train blending into the rather abstract background is needed.</td>', 'Much too busy to be effective, the motion is completely overdone and has literally no impact on the viewer. The author''s intent was clear, but the whole process of capturing this type of image needed more thought. Not a success from a technical or artistic standpoint. A more head on approach to this type of image would have been better and much more effective - a need for more definite shape in the train blending into the rather abstract background is needed.', '2009-04-19 21:33:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444241, 781389, 101256, '<td valign="top">A little better lighting control reducing the highlights would have been a plus. Not an overly interesting image from an artistic sense, it does provide a lot of detail and color differences. A little more thought into the composition would have made for a better image. A good entry into the challenge, it falls just short of being truly effective. Perhaps a little change in viewing angle would have helped.</td>', 'A little better lighting control reducing the highlights would have been a plus. Not an overly interesting image from an artistic sense, it does provide a lot of detail and color differences. A little more thought into the composition would have made for a better image. A good entry into the challenge, it falls just short of being truly effective. Perhaps a little change in viewing angle would have helped.', '2009-04-19 21:34:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444447, 782201, 44025, '<td valign="top">cute</td>', 'cute', '2009-04-19 23:26:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444498, 782205, 33672, '<td valign="top">I like this wide angle photo.</td>', 'I like this wide angle photo.', '2009-04-19 23:48:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444499, 782140, 33672, '<td valign="top">The haze adds a lot to this.</td>', 'The haze adds a lot to this.', '2009-04-19 23:48:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444502, 781383, 33672, '<td valign="top">Eerily good photo.</td>', 'Eerily good photo.', '2009-04-19 23:50:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444503, 782004, 33672, '<td valign="top">I like the old time feel to this. Tones fit perfectly.</td>', 'I like the old time feel to this. Tones fit perfectly.', '2009-04-19 23:51:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444504, 782396, 33672, '<td valign="top">Fascinating photo.</td>', 'Fascinating photo.', '2009-04-19 23:51:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444507, 781505, 33672, '<td valign="top">Fascinating photo. Nice leading lines. Has almost an abstract feel.</td>', 'Fascinating photo. Nice leading lines. Has almost an abstract feel.', '2009-04-19 23:52:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5444509, 781678, 33672, '<td valign="top">I like the unusual DOF. Colors work perfectly.</td>', 'I like the unusual DOF. Colors work perfectly.', '2009-04-19 23:52:55.000000', NULL, 1),
