(5446543, 782051, 102811, '<td valign="top">After looking at photo after photo of just trains and tracks I like the fact that you have introduced a human element to your picture. The Sepia tone works well as does the tilt. Well done.</td>', 'After looking at photo after photo of just trains and tracks I like the fact that you have introduced a human element to your picture. The Sepia tone works well as does the tilt. Well done.', '2009-04-21 07:54:50.000000', NULL, 1),
