(5446834, 782272, 98141, '<td valign="top">I like the way the yellow all ties in together from left to center to right.</td>', 'I like the way the yellow all ties in together from left to center to right.', '2009-04-21 11:25:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5446835, 781200, 98141, '<td valign="top">Fun, metallic, nitty gritty shot.</td>', 'Fun, metallic, nitty gritty shot.', '2009-04-21 11:27:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5446836, 782067, 98141, '<td valign="top">That guy''s hat makes this feel so old timey. The colors work well with that feeling too. I think I''d like it even more if the focus were sharp on the person waiting instead of the sign.</td>', 'That guy''s hat makes this feel so old timey. The colors work well with that feeling too. I think I''d like it even more if the focus were sharp on the person waiting instead of the sign.', '2009-04-21 11:27:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5446838, 782321, 98141, '<td valign="top">Epic. Something about this feel soooo much grander than any other pic I''ve seen in this challenge so far. I think it''s a combination of excellent framing and composition and the man looking soooo little down further away. Fantastic.</td>', 'Epic. Something about this feel soooo much grander than any other pic I''ve seen in this challenge so far. I think it''s a combination of excellent framing and composition and the man looking soooo little down further away. Fantastic.', '2009-04-21 11:29:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5446839, 781536, 98141, '<td valign="top">Nothing feels very sharp about this pic. I don''t think the black and white does it any favors. The train is so dark that it''s hard to make out any details there, just looks like a dark blotch to me. I think if more of the side were included it would be easier to make out details there.</td>', 'Nothing feels very sharp about this pic. I don''t think the black and white does it any favors. The train is so dark that it''s hard to make out any details there, just looks like a dark blotch to me. I think if more of the side were included it would be easier to make out details there.', '2009-04-21 11:30:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5446840, 782357, 96823, '<td valign="top">The tower in the background is a little distracting, maybe a different angle, would have helped. JMO!</td>', 'The tower in the background is a little distracting, maybe a different angle, would have helped. JMO!', '2009-04-21 11:30:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5446841, 781744, 98141, '<td valign="top">I love this, it''s cute and feels fragile, and interetsting representation in a challenge where most other entries are striving for images of tough and powerful machines.</td>', 'I love this, it''s cute and feels fragile, and interetsting representation in a challenge where most other entries are striving for images of tough and powerful machines.', '2009-04-21 11:30:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5446843, 782155, 98141, '<td valign="top">Fun and creative and colorful, three things that I am usually a fan of. Interesting composition, I think it''s a little dark in the areas away from the red, but I enjoyed this.</td>', 'Fun and creative and colorful, three things that I am usually a fan of. Interesting composition, I think it''s a little dark in the areas away from the red, but I enjoyed this.', '2009-04-21 11:31:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5446844, 781116, 96823, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.</td>', 'Nice shot.', '2009-04-21 11:32:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5446846, 782233, 98141, '<td valign="top">I always think it''s funny to see pictures that invoke a color (red) and are presented in black and white. This is very sharp and looks great, but I think it would also pop in color. Especially if you could get that red light to come on! :D</td>', 'I always think it''s funny to see pictures that invoke a color (red) and are presented in black and white. This is very sharp and looks great, but I think it would also pop in color. Especially if you could get that red light to come on! :D', '2009-04-21 11:32:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5446848, 782278, 98141, '<td valign="top">The lighting in this is somewhat spooky, contrasted with a subject that is almost freakishly happy, and I feel like he''s going to turn on us at any moment. Great colors, eerie but maybe that''s just me ;)</td>', 'The lighting in this is somewhat spooky, contrasted with a subject that is almost freakishly happy, and I feel like he''s going to turn on us at any moment. Great colors, eerie but maybe that''s just me ;)', '2009-04-21 11:33:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5446849, 782039, 98141, '<td valign="top">Feels gritty and unplanned to me. The wheels look great in the lower left, but that''s the only element here that really jumps out to me.</td>', 'Feels gritty and unplanned to me. The wheels look great in the lower left, but that''s the only element here that really jumps out to me.', '2009-04-21 11:34:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5446851, 782052, 98141, '<td valign="top">Overexposure is the first thing I notice here. I don''t think the composition, frame, or subject matter really make up for it either. Kind of dull imho.</td>', 'Overexposure is the first thing I notice here. I don''t think the composition, frame, or subject matter really make up for it either. Kind of dull imho.', '2009-04-21 11:35:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5446860, 782214, 98141, '<td valign="top">Great subject, basic compositon, bland in black and white.</td>', 'Great subject, basic compositon, bland in black and white.', '2009-04-21 11:47:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5446864, 781332, 98141, '<td valign="top">The gold and red look great together, glad you kept it in color. Great shot, busy but it works, reminds me of MC Escher almost with all the stairs.</td>', 'The gold and red look great together, glad you kept it in color. Great shot, busy but it works, reminds me of MC Escher almost with all the stairs.', '2009-04-21 11:48:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5446867, 781735, 98141, '<td valign="top">I wonder if the guy right in front of you got sick of hearing your shutter go off - or maybe it''s just me that I would have had to take quite a few shots to get one that turned out this good? Hahaha, nice shot, good motion, visually engaging.</td>', 'I wonder if the guy right in front of you got sick of hearing your shutter go off - or maybe it''s just me that I would have had to take quite a few shots to get one that turned out this good? Hahaha, nice shot, good motion, visually engaging.', '2009-04-21 11:49:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5446869, 781778, 98141, '<td valign="top">This is a great example of how to do an under the train shot. Great color, great depth, great lighting, and interesting composition with the rail coming at an angle from near the lower right corner like that.</td>', 'This is a great example of how to do an under the train shot. Great color, great depth, great lighting, and interesting composition with the rail coming at an angle from near the lower right corner like that.', '2009-04-21 11:50:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5446872, 781199, 98141, '<td valign="top">Spooky! I hope you''ll post your editing process, I would love to know how you got this ghostly effect. Very cool.</td>', 'Spooky! I hope you''ll post your editing process, I would love to know how you got this ghostly effect. Very cool.', '2009-04-21 11:51:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5446874, 782359, 98141, '<td valign="top">I like the wheels and the train in the background, it''s a detail that really makes this shot work for me. I think cropping a little closer on the right would be nice.</td>', 'I like the wheels and the train in the background, it''s a detail that really makes this shot work for me. I think cropping a little closer on the right would be nice.', '2009-04-21 11:51:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5446876, 781810, 98141, '<td valign="top">This train feels huge. I mean, really monstrous. Great angle/POV for the shot.</td>', 'This train feels huge. I mean, really monstrous. Great angle/POV for the shot.', '2009-04-21 11:52:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5446878, 782106, 98141, '<td valign="top">Very interesting shot, wonderful use of focus to bring out your subject, I think this is unique and technically excellent.</td>', 'Very interesting shot, wonderful use of focus to bring out your subject, I think this is unique and technically excellent.', '2009-04-21 11:52:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5446880, 781249, 98141, '<td valign="top">I don''t really think there''s much going on here to pull in the viewer. It feels like your camera was around your neck and it accidentally took a shot. There''s not real subject, the train is barely in the picture, the people are too far away to be the subject, the lamp post and the clock seem to be the subject. There''s just not enough focus here on an acutal subject for me.</td>', 'I don''t really think there''s much going on here to pull in the viewer. It feels like your camera was around your neck and it accidentally took a shot. There''s not real subject, the train is barely in the picture, the people are too far away to be the subject, the lamp post and the clock seem to be the subject. There''s just not enough focus here on an acutal subject for me.', '2009-04-21 11:54:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5446881, 782065, 98141, '<td valign="top">Fun motion shot, though I wish that the rest of the train were a bit blurred and that the building right next to it were sharper, it almost feel like a hand held shot and it makes me feel a bit wobbly.</td>', 'Fun motion shot, though I wish that the rest of the train were a bit blurred and that the building right next to it were sharper, it almost feel like a hand held shot and it makes me feel a bit wobbly.', '2009-04-21 11:54:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5446885, 782348, 98141, '<td valign="top">Haunting and fun. If it weren''t in a Trains challenge I would have no idea what it was though. The shape reminds me of one of those Pacman ghosts.</td>', 'Haunting and fun. If it weren''t in a Trains challenge I would have no idea what it was though. The shape reminds me of one of those Pacman ghosts.', '2009-04-21 11:55:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5446886, 781676, 98141, '<td valign="top">I don''t think the tilt does anything to add to the photo here. Everything is just kind of drab. Might do well in black and white to get rid of some of the dirty feel of it. Or perhaps that''s what you were going for and I''m missing the point completely?</td>', 'I don''t think the tilt does anything to add to the photo here. Everything is just kind of drab. Might do well in black and white to get rid of some of the dirty feel of it. Or perhaps that''s what you were going for and I''m missing the point completely?', '2009-04-21 11:56:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5446888, 781137, 98141, '<td valign="top">Interesting, nice composition, but I''m not sure the negative effect does anything to add to the shot here.</td>', 'Interesting, nice composition, but I''m not sure the negative effect does anything to add to the shot here.', '2009-04-21 11:57:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5446890, 781116, 98141, '<td valign="top">I think this would be really amazing in color, with the mountains and the greenery there. I also think a slightin glower POV would help guide the eye along the photo better, right now I kind of get stuck looking down at the track.</td>', 'I think this would be really amazing in color, with the mountains and the greenery there. I also think a slightin glower POV would help guide the eye along the photo better, right now I kind of get stuck looking down at the track.', '2009-04-21 11:58:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5446892, 782222, 98141, '<td valign="top">I think if the crop weren''t so close in that the grainyness of the shot could really work for it. Or if there were somebody on the ladder. I just don''t think there''s any kind of real focal point or subject here that draws my attention.</td>', 'I think if the crop weren''t so close in that the grainyness of the shot could really work for it. Or if there were somebody on the ladder. I just don''t think there''s any kind of real focal point or subject here that draws my attention.', '2009-04-21 11:59:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5446895, 780757, 98141, '<td valign="top">Is it just me, or whenever I see these levers does everybody really want to pull them? Nice clarity and lighting, but other than my desire to yank on it, the subject doesn''t do much for me.</td>', 'Is it just me, or whenever I see these levers does everybody really want to pull them? Nice clarity and lighting, but other than my desire to yank on it, the subject doesn''t do much for me.', '2009-04-21 12:00:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5446911, 781328, 98141, '<td valign="top">I don''t think this has any wow factor. There''s no pop with the DOF, there''s no pop with the saturation, there''s not really anything moving about the subject (pun not intended :P and although it''s not a bad pic it just doesn''t speak to me.</td>', 'I don''t think this has any wow factor. There''s no pop with the DOF, there''s no pop with the saturation, there''s not really anything moving about the subject (pun not intended :P and although it''s not a bad pic it just doesn''t speak to me.', '2009-04-21 12:08:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5446915, 781308, 98141, '<td valign="top">Fun, different shot, looks great in color and it''s certainly different than watching the original railroads be built. Not that I was there or anything.</td>', 'Fun, different shot, looks great in color and it''s certainly different than watching the original railroads be built. Not that I was there or anything.', '2009-04-21 12:09:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5446918, 782224, 98141, '<td valign="top">Very cute, great lighting and colors, though I think the toy could be a little closer to the camera/corner to make it look a little grander.</td>', 'Very cute, great lighting and colors, though I think the toy could be a little closer to the camera/corner to make it look a little grander.', '2009-04-21 12:09:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5446922, 781148, 98141, '<td valign="top">Interesting use of internal framing, but I''m not sure why you elected to include the person, to me that really makes this a snapshot when it could have been "art." imho</td>', 'Interesting use of internal framing, but I''m not sure why you elected to include the person, to me that really makes this a snapshot when it could have been "art." imho', '2009-04-21 12:10:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5446924, 781160, 98141, '<td valign="top">Great pp, would love to read your steps, the textures all look great and the composition is swell, love the way the sun is peeking through the bars there.</td>', 'Great pp, would love to read your steps, the textures all look great and the composition is swell, love the way the sun is peeking through the bars there.', '2009-04-21 12:10:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5446926, 782223, 98141, '<td valign="top">A little dark, but other than that I really like this shot, it''s got great elements working in it, the person, the steam, the train.</td>', 'A little dark, but other than that I really like this shot, it''s got great elements working in it, the person, the steam, the train.', '2009-04-21 12:11:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5446927, 782044, 98141, '<td valign="top">Well, that is a colorful view of the train! Great textures. I love the silhouette of the person down the way.</td>', 'Well, that is a colorful view of the train! Great textures. I love the silhouette of the person down the way.', '2009-04-21 12:11:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5446929, 782089, 98141, '<td valign="top">Great colors and great details in the stairs falling off and the rust.</td>', 'Great colors and great details in the stairs falling off and the rust.', '2009-04-21 12:12:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5446930, 782201, 98141, '<td valign="top">Wonderful natural symmetry here, a very interesting shot and makes me cringe a little because it looks like you''re about to capture a crash! :P</td>', 'Wonderful natural symmetry here, a very interesting shot and makes me cringe a little because it looks like you''re about to capture a crash! :P', '2009-04-21 12:13:04.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(5446932, 781383, 98141, '<td valign="top">The lights on the train look great, but I wish the lights on the latform were a little brighter to help give the train lights some context.</td>', 'The lights on the train look great, but I wish the lights on the latform were a little brighter to help give the train lights some context.', '2009-04-21 12:13:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5446934, 781739, 98141, '<td valign="top">I love the textures here, it''s smooth and rough all at once. Good framing but I''m not a fan of the heavy, black frame myself.</td>', 'I love the textures here, it''s smooth and rough all at once. Good framing but I''m not a fan of the heavy, black frame myself.', '2009-04-21 12:14:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5446935, 781956, 98141, '<td valign="top">There''s something so light and airy about this shot, the sky looks great, I love the colors here.</td>', 'There''s something so light and airy about this shot, the sky looks great, I love the colors here.', '2009-04-21 12:14:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5446938, 781120, 98141, '<td valign="top">Very fun shot with texture and scale and lots of depth. Love the blue sky, glad you kept it in color.</td>', 'Very fun shot with texture and scale and lots of depth. Love the blue sky, glad you kept it in color.', '2009-04-21 12:15:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5446940, 781700, 98141, '<td valign="top">I wish the colors were way more saturated in this, I bet it originally had a great red pop to it. Not it just seems kind of dark and blah.</td>', 'I wish the colors were way more saturated in this, I bet it originally had a great red pop to it. Not it just seems kind of dark and blah.', '2009-04-21 12:15:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5446942, 781068, 98141, '<td valign="top">Okay, I''m having issues figuring out what''s going on here. Is this a dead person on the tracks? And a video camera. So far, reminding me of something Claire would do on Heroes. But, if that''s not the case, it might be suicide? By train? I''m not really sure. I think the story here is confusing.</td>', 'Okay, I''m having issues figuring out what''s going on here. Is this a dead person on the tracks? And a video camera. So far, reminding me of something Claire would do on Heroes. But, if that''s not the case, it might be suicide? By train? I''m not really sure. I think the story here is confusing.', '2009-04-21 12:16:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5446943, 781127, 98141, '<td valign="top">I love the composition here, the way the buidling is just framed by the mountians and the tracks flow from one side into the distance.</td>', 'I love the composition here, the way the buidling is just framed by the mountians and the tracks flow from one side into the distance.', '2009-04-21 12:17:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5446944, 781709, 98141, '<td valign="top">I think that if a little more of the side were included in a different angle this would have a lot more depth to it.</td>', 'I think that if a little more of the side were included in a different angle this would have a lot more depth to it.', '2009-04-21 12:17:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5446945, 781856, 98141, '<td valign="top">Great texture in the rocks and the rails, unique and interesting and I love the pop of red along the rails.</td>', 'Great texture in the rocks and the rails, unique and interesting and I love the pop of red along the rails.', '2009-04-21 12:18:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5446946, 781506, 98141, '<td valign="top">Light from the flash feels harsh and it''s the first thing I notice. There''s not much of a focus here for me, if there were somebody in the window I think that would work nicely.</td>', 'Light from the flash feels harsh and it''s the first thing I notice. There''s not much of a focus here for me, if there were somebody in the window I think that would work nicely.', '2009-04-21 12:19:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5446947, 781958, 98141, '<td valign="top">It''s a really busy background to have for a portrait, there''s poles coming out of her head and shoulders and it''s very distracting imho.</td>', 'It''s a really busy background to have for a portrait, there''s poles coming out of her head and shoulders and it''s very distracting imho.', '2009-04-21 12:20:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5446948, 782119, 98141, '<td valign="top">A little dark is the first thing I notice, a lot of the details of the darker engine get lost because of it. I like the composition though.</td>', 'A little dark is the first thing I notice, a lot of the details of the darker engine get lost because of it. I like the composition though.', '2009-04-21 12:21:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5446949, 781745, 98141, '<td valign="top">I love the way the yellow pop, but other than that detail I don''t really get any wow factor from this. Just looks like a road. I like the way the rails curve in the distance, I wish this shot had more emphasis on that.</td>', 'I love the way the yellow pop, but other than that detail I don''t really get any wow factor from this. Just looks like a road. I like the way the rails curve in the distance, I wish this shot had more emphasis on that.', '2009-04-21 12:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5446950, 781641, 98141, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what your title means actually... I think you want us to comment on your shot with a possible title for it? I think instead I will let you know why I don''t think I could come up with a title for it: I think your crop is too tight, I don''t think there''s much of a subject for the eye to focus on, I don''t think there''s much depth to it, but I do like the colros, the brown with a little pop of green. So, "Spring Rail."</td>', 'I''m not sure what your title means actually... I think you want us to comment on your shot with a possible title for it? I think instead I will let you know why I don''t think I could come up with a title for it: I think your crop is too tight, I don''t think there''s much of a subject for the eye to focus on, I don''t think there''s much depth to it, but I do like the colros, the brown with a little pop of green. So, "Spring Rail."', '2009-04-21 12:24:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5446952, 782434, 98141, '<td valign="top">The red looks fantastic but the shine of the rest of this pic is distracting to me, I don''t get the feeling of much of a subject here.</td>', 'The red looks fantastic but the shine of the rest of this pic is distracting to me, I don''t get the feeling of much of a subject here.', '2009-04-21 12:24:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5446955, 782277, 98141, '<td valign="top">Your score is going to get killed for this. I have to say I agree that it DNMC. I get that this is a kind of train, but since the title is trains and railroads, I think that it''s clear what kind of train was meant. Also, the carpet as a background is distracting, the lighting is harsh (probably from flash), the wood from the wall in the upper corner is distracting and adds to the snapshot feel, the Bible being in the center of the photo is not great composition, I think the contrast could come up a smidge, and I''m not trying to be overly harsh, just honest and I hope this comment is helpful to you.</td>', 'Your score is going to get killed for this. I have to say I agree that it DNMC. I get that this is a kind of train, but since the title is trains and railroads, I think that it''s clear what kind of train was meant. Also, the carpet as a background is distracting, the lighting is harsh (probably from flash), the wood from the wall in the upper corner is distracting and adds to the snapshot feel, the Bible being in the center of the photo is not great composition, I think the contrast could come up a smidge, and I''m not trying to be overly harsh, just honest and I hope this comment is helpful to you.', '2009-04-21 12:25:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5446964, 781553, 80087, '<td valign="top">neat idea</td>', 'neat idea', '2009-04-21 12:31:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5446969, 782277, 80087, '<td valign="top">ouch</td>', 'ouch', '2009-04-21 12:36:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5447156, 782431, 50695, '<td valign="top">Visionary.<br/> <br/>I give you a Posthumous Blue Ribbon. <img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg"/></td>', 'Visionary. I give you a Posthumous Blue Ribbon. ', '2009-04-21 15:22:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5447160, 781177, 50695, '<td valign="top">The essence of train. I give you a Posthumous Red Ribbon.<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg"/></td>', 'The essence of train. I give you a Posthumous Red Ribbon. ', '2009-04-21 15:23:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5447162, 782205, 50695, '<td valign="top">A silent, solitary moment that is strangely compelling.</td>', 'A silent, solitary moment that is strangely compelling.', '2009-04-21 15:24:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5447164, 782126, 50695, '<td valign="top">The silhouetting and the framing create an unexpected flatness to this, the sense of cutouts on a light table, or characters laid upon a world. Posthumous Yellow Ribbon for you.<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg"/></td>', 'The silhouetting and the framing create an unexpected flatness to this, the sense of cutouts on a light table, or characters laid upon a world. Posthumous Yellow Ribbon for you. ', '2009-04-21 15:27:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5447165, 782232, 50695, '<td valign="top">Beautiful texture, chiaroscuro, sense of depth... 9</td>', 'Beautiful texture, chiaroscuro, sense of depth... 9', '2009-04-21 15:27:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5447166, 781867, 50695, '<td valign="top">Captivating.</td>', 'Captivating.', '2009-04-21 15:28:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5447167, 782336, 50695, '<td valign="top">Lovely.</td>', 'Lovely.', '2009-04-21 15:28:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5447169, 782140, 50695, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous light.</td>', 'Gorgeous light.', '2009-04-21 15:28:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5447170, 781964, 50695, '<td valign="top">great environmental portrait!</td>', 'great environmental portrait!', '2009-04-21 15:28:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5447171, 782311, 50695, '<td valign="top">I dig this. I feel like I''m being beamed away, Scottie.</td>', 'I dig this. I feel like I''m being beamed away, Scottie.', '2009-04-21 15:29:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5447172, 782371, 50695, '<td valign="top">Beautiful abstract composition, like Klee.</td>', 'Beautiful abstract composition, like Klee.', '2009-04-21 15:29:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5447173, 781854, 50695, '<td valign="top">7 for a great title.</td>', '7 for a great title.', '2009-04-21 15:29:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5447175, 782161, 50695, '<td valign="top">Weird and wonderful.</td>', 'Weird and wonderful.', '2009-04-21 15:30:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5447176, 782172, 50695, '<td valign="top">Great effect. This is a fun shot.</td>', 'Great effect. This is a fun shot.', '2009-04-21 15:30:23.000000', NULL, 1),
