(5447819, 782418, 79079, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your top 10 finish, Rob!  Love your free study shot, too.  Can''t believe our luck of finding the same place.  If I had realized that was already in your free study entry, I wonder what I might have found to shoot later into the night?  Probably would have been mugged or something -- things more likely worked out for the best...  :D<br/> <br/>Perhaps if I had stayed with one of my wider shots I could have given you more of a run for your money!  ;)  Hope next time we are of-one-mind that we actually get to meet.</td>', 'Congrats on your top 10 finish, Rob!  Love your free study shot, too.  Can''t believe our luck of finding the same place.  If I had realized that was already in your free study entry, I wonder what I might have found to shoot later into the night?  Probably would have been mugged or something -- things more likely worked out for the best...  :D Perhaps if I had stayed with one of my wider shots I could have given you more of a run for your money!  ;)  Hope next time we are of-one-mind that we actually get to meet.', '2009-04-22 01:47:46.000000', NULL, 0),
