(5448039, 781721, 62281, '<td valign="top">Thanks Lutchenko, I think you right, not many British voter on here who would know about this type of engine or style of rail painting.<br/> <br/>Funny thing is I have a shot from the same weekend very near identical to the 2nd placed one but did not want to have just another steam loco.</td>', 'Thanks Lutchenko, I think you right, not many British voter on here who would know about this type of engine or style of rail painting. Funny thing is I have a shot from the same weekend very near identical to the 2nd placed one but did not want to have just another steam loco.', '2009-04-22 05:47:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(5448044, 782420, 99263, '<td valign="top">Congratz on the third place. Lovely and deserving image. Care to explain now how you managed to get this effect under basic or is that to remain your secret exclusively?<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-04-22 04:49:14.</i></td>', 'Congratz on the third place. Lovely and deserving image. Care to explain now how you managed to get this effect under basic or is that to remain your secret exclusively?', '2009-04-22 05:48:47.000000', '2009-04-22 05:49:14.000000', 0),
(5448048, 781723, 99263, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot and deserving 2nd place winner. As mentioned by others already the only niggle is the crop in front.<br/>I would love to know your processing here. Do you mind explaining it here? If not could you PM me the details of how to achieve this look under basic editing? I would appreciate it very much.</td>', 'Lovely shot and deserving 2nd place winner. As mentioned by others already the only niggle is the crop in front.I would love to know your processing here. Do you mind explaining it here? If not could you PM me the details of how to achieve this look under basic editing? I would appreciate it very much.', '2009-04-22 05:52:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(5448061, 781723, 20608, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Sangiro:</b></div><hr/><i> Lovely shot and deserving 2nd place winner. As mentioned by others already the only niggle is the crop in front.<br/>I would love to know your processing here. Do you mind explaining it here? If not could you PM me the details of how to achieve this look under basic editing? I would appreciate it very much. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Fill light, highlights &amp; shadows and curves with noise ninja will all work to get this result.<br/>Thanks</td>', 'Originally posted by Sangiro: Lovely shot and deserving 2nd place winner. As mentioned by others already the only niggle is the crop in front.I would love to know your processing here. Do you mind explaining it here? If not could you PM me the details of how to achieve this look under basic editing? I would appreciate it very much.   Fill light, highlights & shadows and curves with noise ninja will all work to get this result.Thanks', '2009-04-22 05:58:48.000000', NULL, 0),
