(5448090, 782420, 96989, '<td valign="top">Lovely colours and clarity. The HDR halo however is unfortunately very very prominent. I''m surprised how many people overlooked it. Congrats on the ribbon though.</td>', 'Lovely colours and clarity. The HDR halo however is unfortunately very very prominent. I''m surprised how many people overlooked it. Congrats on the ribbon though.', '2009-04-22 07:00:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(5448092, 781723, 96989, '<td valign="top">Wow, I''m surprised that #2 and #3 winners in this contest both have really obvious halos in the images. I would have thought that is one of the biggest no nos in crafting a photo. It certainly is on a professional level. This contest really helped give me a better understanding of the cross section of people on this site.<br/>But congrats on the ribbon, it''s still a great photograph in many other ways.<br/></td>', 'Wow, I''m surprised that #2 and #3 winners in this contest both have really obvious halos in the images. I would have thought that is one of the biggest no nos in crafting a photo. It certainly is on a professional level. This contest really helped give me a better understanding of the cross section of people on this site.But congrats on the ribbon, it''s still a great photograph in many other ways.', '2009-04-22 07:03:47.000000', NULL, 0),
