(5449051, 782420, 39057, '<td valign="top">LOL...I would need to know more about "a little of this...a little of that" before I could tackle something like this....but I''ll try.</td>', 'LOL...I would need to know more about "a little of this...a little of that" before I could tackle something like this....but I''ll try.', '2009-04-22 18:23:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(5449053, 782420, 71657, '<td valign="top">Looks like some dodge and burn to certain parts of the pic.  Is that legal in basic?  Also, the halo effect leads me to believe this is an HDR image.  How did you get the halo around the train and not the trees?  I think that is not allowed also.  I think a little of this and a little of that is kind of questionable.  To pull a photo out like this, I would have these steps saved and memorized so I could use it on future photos.  Assuming it is a legal shot, congrats on the ribbon.  I hope for your rep it is legal, as I will try to duplicate this with " alittle of this and a little of that", but I don''t feel confident about it.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-04-22 18:30:39.</i></td>', 'Looks like some dodge and burn to certain parts of the pic.  Is that legal in basic?  Also, the halo effect leads me to believe this is an HDR image.  How did you get the halo around the train and not the trees?  I think that is not allowed also.  I think a little of this and a little of that is kind of questionable.  To pull a photo out like this, I would have these steps saved and memorized so I could use it on future photos.  Assuming it is a legal shot, congrats on the ribbon.  I hope for your rep it is legal, as I will try to duplicate this with " alittle of this and a little of that", but I don''t feel confident about it.', '2009-04-22 18:24:28.000000', '2009-04-22 19:30:39.000000', 0),
(5449125, 781505, 23002, '<td valign="top">Great shot Jonathan!  congrats on another top 10!</td>', 'Great shot Jonathan!  congrats on another top 10!', '2009-04-22 19:27:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(5449145, 782420, 71657, '<td valign="top">Basic editing rules:<br/> <br/>You may not:<br/> <br/>spot-edit your entry, except to remove sensor dust or hot pixels<br/> <br/>use any selection tool, including but not limited to the marquee, lasso, layer masks, quick masks, or any similar tool to select a portion of your image for any reason other than cropping or creating a border. <br/> <br/>use ANY editing tool to create new image area, objects or features (such as <b>VIGNETTES</b>, lens flare or motion) that didnt already exist in your original capture.<br/> <br/>An entry will be disqualified when a majority of the Site Council finds that <b>ANY</b> of the rules above were not followed. <br/> <br/>The above penalties will be assessed only after review by the Site Council. In exceptional circumstances, the Site Council may elect not to apply a penalty. <b>If a user is found to have intentionally violated the Challenge Rules,</b> the above penalties will be in addition to any assessed for the violation itself. <br/> <br/></td>', 'Basic editing rules: You may not: spot-edit your entry, except to remove sensor dust or hot pixels use any selection tool, including but not limited to the marquee, lasso, layer masks, quick masks, or any similar tool to select a portion of your image for any reason other than cropping or creating a border.  use ANY editing tool to create new image area, objects or features (such as VIGNETTES, lens flare or motion) that didnt already exist in your original capture. An entry will be disqualified when a majority of the Site Council finds that ANY of the rules above were not followed.  The above penalties will be assessed only after review by the Site Council. In exceptional circumstances, the Site Council may elect not to apply a penalty. If a user is found to have intentionally violated the Challenge Rules, the above penalties will be in addition to any assessed for the violation itself.  ', '2009-04-22 19:48:29.000000', NULL, 0),
