(5449359, 782420, 39057, '<td valign="top">Some dude named Joey L. actually made a lot of dough explaining his process....and I think the process you developed in "basic" rivals his in "advanced". <br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by LydiaToo:</b></div><hr/><i> No fun??!    Consider again please, Tom.<br/> <br/>It was a Basic Editing challenge and you have so many people questioning your talent even AFTER you''ve passed validation?<br/> <br/>Consider this a compliment of the highest regard! <br/> <br/>I personally congratulate you on your ribbon and encourage you to take all ''questions'' as compliments and as opportunities to help others grow in the photography course as you have.   Tell all.    Then, you''ll be a hero.  *smile*<br/> <br/>Congrats again. </i></td></tr></table></td>', 'Some dude named Joey L. actually made a lot of dough explaining his process....and I think the process you developed in "basic" rivals his in "advanced".  Originally posted by LydiaToo: No fun??!    Consider again please, Tom. It was a Basic Editing challenge and you have so many people questioning your talent even AFTER you''ve passed validation? Consider this a compliment of the highest regard!  I personally congratulate you on your ribbon and encourage you to take all ''questions'' as compliments and as opportunities to help others grow in the photography course as you have.   Tell all.    Then, you''ll be a hero.  *smile* Congrats again. ', '2009-04-22 22:03:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(5449494, 782321, 102315, '<td valign="top">The subject, for me, just doesn''t "pop" but everyone''s definition of "pop" is different. From the score I received in this challenge I may not be the one to tell you what''s wrong with your''s but for me personally I think color would have made this shot better. I think the lights reflecting off the side of the train are distracting and really shine too much in the B&amp;W image. Very distracting to the eye. From what I am starting to learn on this site is that I think their are a ton of "quick" voters and if you can''t make a voter stop on your photo for more than 2 seconds your bound to stay in 5 territory.</td>', 'The subject, for me, just doesn''t "pop" but everyone''s definition of "pop" is different. From the score I received in this challenge I may not be the one to tell you what''s wrong with your''s but for me personally I think color would have made this shot better. I think the lights reflecting off the side of the train are distracting and really shine too much in the B&W image. Very distracting to the eye. From what I am starting to learn on this site is that I think their are a ton of "quick" voters and if you can''t make a voter stop on your photo for more than 2 seconds your bound to stay in 5 territory.', '2009-04-22 23:47:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(5449514, 782338, 37845, '<td valign="top">Hey Max!!!  Nice shot... deserved a better score, but I like your unique composition on it. You brought out a lot of colour on the train considering the grey skies. <br/> <br/>Looking forward to the next time we can all shoot together :) I will try to actually take some shots then :)</td>', 'Hey Max!!!  Nice shot... deserved a better score, but I like your unique composition on it. You brought out a lot of colour on the train considering the grey skies.  Looking forward to the next time we can all shoot together :) I will try to actually take some shots then :)', '2009-04-23 00:04:53.000000', NULL, 0),
