(5454304, 781723, 104230, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on getting a ribbon for this lovely shot.  Just the colors/colours of the engine and carriages take me back to the train rides of my youth growing up in the West of England.  If you had been able to include primroses in flower along the rail embankment, now that would have made the memory complete!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-04-27 21:11:40.</i></td>', 'Congratulations on getting a ribbon for this lovely shot.  Just the colors/colours of the engine and carriages take me back to the train rides of my youth growing up in the West of England.  If you had been able to include primroses in flower along the rail embankment, now that would have made the memory complete!', '2009-04-27 17:29:07.000000', '2009-04-27 22:11:40.000000', 0),
