(5456594, 781605, 70270, '<td valign="top">Nice detail and B+W conversion, Les ... this was my favorite of the "wheel shots" in the challenge.  Should have done much better than it did.</td>', 'Nice detail and B+W conversion, Les ... this was my favorite of the "wheel shots" in the challenge.  Should have done much better than it did.', '2009-04-29 03:05:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(5456596, 781332, 70270, '<td valign="top">Loved the lighting and sharpness, and the forms and for the most part the composition.  Wished the P in ennsylvania wasn''t cut off, and would have liked to have seen where those stairs led. Gave you a 6</td>', 'Loved the lighting and sharpness, and the forms and for the most part the composition.  Wished the P in ennsylvania wasn''t cut off, and would have liked to have seen where those stairs led. Gave you a 6', '2009-04-29 03:08:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(5456598, 782380, 70270, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, well composed for what it is, though a little cut off on the right side of the frame.  I gave you a 6; was a little bit static for me, which is why it didn''t make it into my 7+ range, though technically very well done.</td>', 'Nice shot, well composed for what it is, though a little cut off on the right side of the frame.  I gave you a 6; was a little bit static for me, which is why it didn''t make it into my 7+ range, though technically very well done.', '2009-04-29 03:11:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(5456601, 782205, 70270, '<td valign="top">I kept bumping this one up during the challenge (gave you a 7), and it continues to grow on me the more I look at it.  That guy on the left makes the shot.  Nice entry.</td>', 'I kept bumping this one up during the challenge (gave you a 7), and it continues to grow on me the more I look at it.  That guy on the left makes the shot.  Nice entry.', '2009-04-29 03:13:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(5456604, 781739, 70270, '<td valign="top">I liked the technicals on this a lot, but ultimately gave you a 5 because there just wasn''t enough interest in the subject to carry me higher.  As a detail shot in a photo essay, it would have been perfect; as a stand alone it didn''t grab me.</td>', 'I liked the technicals on this a lot, but ultimately gave you a 5 because there just wasn''t enough interest in the subject to carry me higher.  As a detail shot in a photo essay, it would have been perfect; as a stand alone it didn''t grab me.', '2009-04-29 03:15:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(5456605, 781301, 70270, '<td valign="top">good crispness and detail, but for me the composition pushed it down, both because the swoop of the fender was lost and the square box in the foreground was cut in half.  Gave you a 5 on the technicals (and I like the glare/reflections, think they added to the image).</td>', 'good crispness and detail, but for me the composition pushed it down, both because the swoop of the fender was lost and the square box in the foreground was cut in half.  Gave you a 5 on the technicals (and I like the glare/reflections, think they added to the image).', '2009-04-29 03:17:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(5456606, 782184, 70270, '<td valign="top">This was a real nice shot, the steam gave it a lot of energy and interest.  I was one of your many 7s; congrats on the nice placement.</td>', 'This was a real nice shot, the steam gave it a lot of energy and interest.  I was one of your many 7s; congrats on the nice placement.', '2009-04-29 03:20:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(5456607, 782089, 70270, '<td valign="top">Nicely found subject and scene, the grass at the base really accentuates the subject. I gave it a 6 and was surprised it did not place higher.  Colors and sharpness are spot on, as usual.</td>', 'Nicely found subject and scene, the grass at the base really accentuates the subject. I gave it a 6 and was surprised it did not place higher.  Colors and sharpness are spot on, as usual.', '2009-04-29 03:23:24.000000', NULL, 0),
