(6470245, 781125, 64446, '<td valign="top">I like the concept of the parallel lines and the distortion caused by the heat, adding some interesting dynamics to the image.<br/>As it was noted, maybe if you had added an element of abandonment (e.g. an old shoe, or any trash) would be more appealing to voters. Also, you should have use the maximum size allowed for the image (800 pixels wide), which always help bring the details up.</td>', 'I like the concept of the parallel lines and the distortion caused by the heat, adding some interesting dynamics to the image.As it was noted, maybe if you had added an element of abandonment (e.g. an old shoe, or any trash) would be more appealing to voters. Also, you should have use the maximum size allowed for the image (800 pixels wide), which always help bring the details up.', '2011-07-14 04:33:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(6596268, 781177, 49018, '<td valign="top"><img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=20799" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">tome</a> directed me to your ''Japanese Train'' image and by chance I stumbled in this.<br/>So glad I did.<br/>Wonderful.</td>', ' tome directed me to your ''Japanese Train'' image and by chance I stumbled in this.So glad I did.Wonderful.', '2011-11-16 08:47:27.000000', NULL, 0),
