(7049679, 781177, 87278, '<td valign="top">Brilliant. You command my admiration for your ability to create stunning visuals with the least amount of light and shade and forms and shapes. As a railway man''s son I always had a fascination for trains and engines and this really is a staggering short that kindles nostalgia all the way back some 50 years! :)</td>', 'Brilliant. You command my admiration for your ability to create stunning visuals with the least amount of light and shade and forms and shapes. As a railway man''s son I always had a fascination for trains and engines and this really is a staggering short that kindles nostalgia all the way back some 50 years! :)', '2013-06-08 05:52:39.000000', NULL, 0),
